k', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nina Bernstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bernstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5fbed5b-bda2-5a3d-826c-0d83632dc903', 'word_count': 445, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5fbed5b-bda2-5a3d-826c-0d83632dc903'}, {'abstract': 'Once revered for his political efforts, he continues to be hounded by an online sex scandal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/01/nyregion/a-chilly-reception-for-weiner-in-rockaways.html', 'snippet': 'Once revered for his political efforts, he continues to be hounded by an online sex scandal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For much of his career in politics, Anthony D. Weiner was revered in the far-flung community of the Rockaways, Queens. He was credited with helping lead the fight to protect beaches and applauded for his efforts to assist families affected by storm damage.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/nyregion/TRAILSIDE5/TRAILSIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/01/nyregion/TRAILSIDE5/TRAILSIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/nyregion/TRAILSIDE5/TRAILSIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/nyregion/TRAILSIDE5/TRAILSIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', '