senal in Kiev, the largest art institution in Ukraine, has been accused of censorship and catering to church and state after she painted over in black a mural she had commissioned from the contemporary artist Volodymyr Kuznetsov.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Museum Director in Ukraine Paints Over a Mural She Doesn’t Like', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kiev (Ukraine)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-01T16:51:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sophia Kishkovsky', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sophia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kishkovsky', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2b7aef3f-7129-52cf-8328-ed6b32f0196a', 'word_count': 482, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2b7aef3f-7129-52cf-8328-ed6b32f0196a'}, {'abstract': 'The collapse of spending measures increased the prospects of a government shutdown in the fall and added new urgency to fiscal negotiations between the White House and a bloc of Senate Republicans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/us/politics/budget-chief-sees-opening-in-house-gop-infighting.html', 'snippet': 'The collapse of spending measures increased the prospects of a government shutdown in the fall and added new urgency to fiscal negotiations between the White House and a bloc of Senate Republicans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Hours before leaving on summer recess, Congress on Thursday hit a seemingly intractable impasse on government spending, increasing the prospects of a government shutdown in the fall and adding new urgency to fiscal negotiations between the White House and a bloc of Senate Repub