64e5', 'word_count': 379, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6f5c2c8-02b3-5717-bae7-3b8a2a1164e5'}, {'abstract': 'A new accounting Web site says it offers small businesses the same level of service that big businesses get, including help from a team of accountants and bookkeepers.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/01/a-virtual-accounting-department-for-small-businesses/', 'snippet': 'A new accounting Web site says it offers small businesses the same level of service that big businesses get, including help from a team of accountants and bookkeepers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Ian Crosby was in college six years ago in Vancouver, British Columbia, he really wanted to work at a video game company and got a job at one — as its bookkeeper. He learned two things: bookkeeping wasn’t a job he liked much and automating many of the bookkeeper’s tasks saved him a lot of time.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Virtual Accounting Department for Small Businesses', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACCOUNTING AND ACCOUNTANTS', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Outsourcing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-01T17:00:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eilene Zimmerman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eilene', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zimmerman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cf446c49-4bf6-5180-bb2d-ee99f5266575', 'word_count': 1063, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cf446c49-4bf6-5180-bb2d-ee99f5266575'}, {'abstract': 'Ben Stiller stars in and directed “The Secret Life of Walter Mitty,” based on James Thurber’s classic short story about a melancholy daydreamer.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/01/imagine-that-walter-mitty-is-centerpiece-of-new-york-film-festival/', 'snippet': 'Ben Stiller stars in and directed “The Secret Life of Walter Mitty,” based on James Thurber’s classic short story about a melancholy daydreamer.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Secret Life of Walter Mitty” originated as a classic short story in The New Yorker, so it’s only fitting that a new film adaptation of it should have its world premiere at the New York Film Festival. Ben Stiller’s cinematic take on the James Thurber tale, which Mr. Stiller directed and in which he plays the melancholy daydreamer of its title, will be presented on Oct. 5 as the centerpiece gala selection of the New York Film Festival, the Film Society of Lincoln Center said on Thursday. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/arts/mitty/mitty-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 318, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/01/arts/mitty/mitty-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 318}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/arts/mitty/mitty-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 542, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/arts/mitty/mitty-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1084, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/01/arts/mitty/mitty-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legac