s and demonstrations to illustrate Debussy’s “Préludes” Book II on Wednesday at Lincoln Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/arts/music/efflam-bavouzet-performs-at-kaplan-penthouse.html', 'snippet': 'Jean-Efflam Bavouzet used stories and demonstrations to illustrate Debussy’s “Préludes” Book II on Wednesday at Lincoln Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Musicians sometimes introduce the works on their programs, a welcome evolution in the concert format and one that adds an appealing element of intimacy. The superb pianist Jean-Efflam Bavouzet took a more unusual approach when, after beginning Debussy’s “Préludes” Book II at the Kaplan Penthouse on Wednesday evening, he stopped abruptly a few notes into “Puerta del Vino” and began an energetic discourse on Debussy’s aesthetic.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02NIGHT_SPAN/NIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02NIGHT_SPAN/NIGHT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02NIGHT_SPAN/NIGHT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02NIGHT_SPAN/NIGHT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1348, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02NIGHT_SPAN/NIGHT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/