journalists posted messages on social networks welcoming Edward J. Snowden to his new home.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/01/russian-bloggers-welcome-snowden-with-jokes-praise-and-job-offers/', 'snippet': 'Russian bloggers, activists, entrepreneurs and journalists posted messages on social networks welcoming Edward J. Snowden to his new home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, Friday, 11:32 a.m. When the former United States intelligence analyst Edward J. Snowden was finally allowed to leave his limbo in the transit zone of Moscow’s Sheremetyevo airport on Thursday with a permit granting him political asylum in Russia, Russian bloggers, activists, entrepreneurs and journalists posted messages on social networks welcoming him to his new home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russian Bloggers Welcome Snowden With Jokes, Praise and Job Offers', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asylum, Right of', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-01T23:55:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ilya Mouzykantskii and Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ilya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mouzykantskii', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c640f29-0775-58e5-a4ee-953957d72bcb', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c640f29-0775-58e5-a4ee-953957d72bcb'}, {'abstract': 'The Cuddy, named for the little cabin offering shelter on a boat, serves Southern and gastro-pub dishes in a maritime setting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/04/nyregion/a-review-of-the-cuddy-in-sag-harbor.html', 'snippet': 'The Cuddy, named for the little cabin offering shelter on a boat, serves Southern and gastro-pub dishes in a maritime setting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a balmy July evening, Main Street in Sag Harbor churned with a weekend crowd of locals, tourists and boating types who roamed the sidewalks, peering into the windows of packed restaurants. Feeling a little smug about our reservations, we breezed past a cluster of people waiting at the entrance to the Cuddy, which occupies a charming storefront in the heart of the village. With its rough-hewed interior softened by candlelight and a menu that leans toward hearty gastro-pub fare, it offered an appealing haven from all the activity outside. ', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/04DINELI1_SPAN/04DINELI1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 595, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/04DINELI1_SPAN/04DINELI1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 595}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/04DINELI1_SPAN/04DINELI1_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1015, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/04DINELI1_SPAN/04DINELI1_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1996, 'width': 2013, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'