, '_id': 'nyt://article/58da4abb-946e-558f-9291-e50e9704da09', 'word_count': 792, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58da4abb-946e-558f-9291-e50e9704da09'}, {'abstract': 'In “Breakup at a Wedding,” a bride gets cold feet, but the couple decide to go through with the ceremony anyway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/movies/breakup-at-a-wedding-directed-by-victor-quinaz.html', 'snippet': 'In “Breakup at a Wedding,” a bride gets cold feet, but the couple decide to go through with the ceremony anyway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s not much new to be wrung out of the wedding-catastrophe plotline, but if you’re the kind who is always up for a calamity-filled trip down the aisle, “Breakup at a Wedding” is a moderately amusing application of the formula.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/arts/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN/02RDP_BREAKUP_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_nam