 from the food stamp program threatens to derail efforts by the House and Senate to complete a farm bill before agriculture programs expire on Sept. 30.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A plan by House leaders to cut $40 billion from the food stamp program — twice the amount of cuts proposed in a House bill that failed in June — threatens to derail efforts by the House and Senate to work together to complete a farm bill before agriculture programs expire on Sept. 30. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'G.O.P. Push to Slash Food Stamps Puts Farm Bill in Jeopardy', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'G.O.P. Push to Slash Food Stamps Puts Farm Bill in Jeopardy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Farm Bill (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food Stamps', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lucas, Frank D', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-02T02:14:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ron Nixon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ron', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nixon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d58a12dc-1bad-5dbc-baea-bed86b372101', 'word_count': 563, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d58a12dc-1bad-5dbc-baea-bed86b372101'}, {'abstract': 'A suspect in two assaults was charged on Thursday with the murder of Amy E. Lord, a 24-year-old South Boston woman found dead last week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/us/massachusetts-charge-set-in-boston-womans-death.html', 'snippet': 'A suspect in two assaults was charged on Thursday with the murder of Amy E. Lord, a 24-year-old South Boston woman found dead last week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A suspect in two assaults was charged on Thursday with the murder of Amy E. Lord, a 24-year-old South Boston woman found dead last week. The authorities said Ms. Lord was abducted near her apartment on July 23, forced to withdraw money from five nearby A.T.M.’s, and stabbed to death in a nature reservation in the city’s Hyde Park neighborhood. The suspect, Edwin J. Alemany, 28, was arrested July 24 and charged in connection with two nonfatal attacks around the same time. The authorities said he was linked to Ms. Lord’s murder by forensic and surveillance evidence. Mr. Alemany will be arraigned after a mental health evaluation. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Massachusetts: Charge Set in Boston Woman’s Death', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | New England', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Massachusetts: Charge Set In Boston Woman’s Death', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bidgood, Jess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and Attempted Murders', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lord, Amy E', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alemany, Edwin J', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-02T02:23:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jess Bidgood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jess', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bidgood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://