urope/us-and-russia-snowden.html', 'snippet': 'There were signs that the United States and Russia might try to contain the fallout over Russia’s decision to grant temporary asylum to Edward J. Snowden, the fugitive intelligence analyst.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MOSCOW — Edward J. Snowden, the fugitive intelligence analyst, settled into a secluded, uncertain self-exile here on Friday amid signs that the United States and Russia might try to contain the diplomatic fallout over Russia’s decision to grant him temporary asylum.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1387, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/snowden/snowden-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Envoy and Putin Aide Discuss Snowden', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. Envoy and Putin Aide Discuss Snowden', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Snowden, Edward J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McFaul, Michael A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Surveillance of Citizens by Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Security Agency', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moscow (Russia)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-02T15:39:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Lee Myers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Lee', 'lastname': 'Myers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c6c7364-3ffd-5078-82f7-3a9feb57ff23', 'word_count': 600, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c6c7364-3ffd-5078-82f7-3a9feb57ff23'}, {'abstract': 'Finding value at running back in the middle rounds of drafts could be the key to fantasy football success in 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/03/sports/football/fantasy-football-spotting-undervalued-running-backs.html', 'snippet': 'Finding value at running back in the middle rounds of drafts could be the key to fantasy football success in 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Running backs are being targeted early this season in the world of fantasy football with owners scrambling to gobble up two top runners in the first couple rounds of drafts. It seems l