 “Restless Creature,” which is made up of four dances by contemporary choreographers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/04/arts/dance/wendy-whelan-embraces-contemporary-dance.html', 'snippet': 'The dancer Wendy Whelan prepares for her project “Restless Creature,” which is made up of four dances by contemporary choreographers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After 29 years with one of the world’s most demanding ballet companies, some dancers might start to feel worn out. Wendy Whelan, the New York City Ballet principal, has the opposite problem.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04WHELAN1_SPAN/04WHELAN1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 490, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04WHELAN1_SPAN/04WHELAN1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 490}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04WHELAN1_SPAN/04WHELAN1_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 836, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04WHELAN1_SPAN/04WHELAN1_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1671, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04WHELAN1_SPAN/04WHELAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04WHELAN1_SPAN/04WHELAN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur