67b-503a-988a-5cbe9e7e0e30'}, {'abstract': 'The folk-rock duo the Civil Wars have a new album mirroring the tensions that led to their split. Will the lack of a concert tour hurt sales?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/04/arts/music/from-the-civil-wars-an-aptly-named-album.html', 'snippet': 'The folk-rock duo the Civil Wars have a new album mirroring the tensions that led to their split. Will the lack of a concert tour hurt sales?', 'lead_paragraph': 'A year ago, the folk-rock duo the Civil Wars seemed to be golden. Their 2011 debut album, “Barton Hollow,” had sold a half-million copies without a major label and won them two Grammy Awards. They had toured with Adele and Emmylou Harris and collaborated with Taylor Swift on a hit song. More success seemed certain.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04JPCIVIL/04JPCIVIL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 413, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04JPCIVIL/04JPCIVIL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 413}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04JPCIVIL/04JPCIVIL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04JPCIVIL/04JPCIVIL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1411, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/arts/04JPCIVIL/04JPCIVIL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/