e Hollywood — ostensibly to discuss his coming movie, “The Monuments Men” — to inveigh against the hedge fund manager and his campaign against Sony.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/george-clooney-rebuts-loebs-critique-of-sony/', 'snippet': 'The actor and producer took time during an interview with Deadline Hollywood — ostensibly to discuss his coming movie, “The Monuments Men” — to inveigh against the hedge fund manager and his campaign against Sony.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Daniel S. Loeb has been steadily ratcheting up his critique of Sony in recent days. But the conglomerate found a defender in a somewhat unlikely source: George Clooney.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'George Clooney Rebuts Loeb’s Critique of Sony', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hedge Funds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clooney, George', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Loeb, Daniel S', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Third Point LLC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-02T19:43:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c34dc640-c364-5525-87f8-fb2426d02eb6', 'word_count': 424, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c34dc640-c364-5525-87f8-fb2426d02eb6'}, {'abstract': 'Looking for every advantage, more students are taking — and retaking, and submitting — both the SAT and ACT. Does it help?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/04/education/edlife/more-students-are-taking-both-the-act-and-sat.html', 'snippet': 'Looking for every advantage, more students are taking — and retaking, and submitting — both the SAT and ACT. Does it help?', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS if applying to college isn’t taxing enough, the process seems to have been ratcheted up another notch. Ambitious high school students are no longer content with just one college admissions test. Not a single college requires it, but many applicants to the nation’s most selective colleges and universities are taking — and retaking — both the ACT and the SAT.', 'print_section': 'ED', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/education/04EDLIFE_395/04EDLIFE_395-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/education/04EDLIFE_395/04EDLIFE_395-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/education/04EDLIFE_395/04EDLIFE_395-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/04/education/04EDLIFE_395/04EDLIFE_395-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/education/04EDLIFE_395/04EDLIFE_395-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Testing, Testing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Testing, Testing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, '