beat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/what-inspired-you-to-work-in-video-games/', 'snippet': 'We want to hear from video game professionals about what inspired their careers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This summer, The New York Times is publishing essays by its critics about the moments or works that prompted them to write about the arts, along with stories from readers about their own epiphanies. Previously we heard from readers who work in television, classical music, dance and pop music.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Inspired You to Work in Video Games?', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-02T20:00:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/27278951-6421-50cc-a63b-fee5cba076a8', 'word_count': 193, 'uri': 'nyt://article/27278951-6421-50cc-a63b-fee5cba076a8'}, {'abstract': 'A research report finds a surprising correlation between the pace of truck sales and the ability of stocks to outperform bonds.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/02/keep-on-truckin/', 'snippet': 'A research report finds a surprising correlation between the pace of truck sales and the ability of stocks to outperform bonds.', 'lead_paragraph': ' The connection may sound obscure, but as David Bowers of Absolute Strategy Research in London notes, there is a surprising correlation between the pace of truck sales and the ability of stocks to outperform bonds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Keep On Truckin’', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords':