026-aa41-fa55b504588b'}, {'abstract': 'Inbee Park of South Korea, who is seeking her fourth major title of the season, carded a one-over 73 in the second round of the Women’s British Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/03/sports/golf/wind-pushes-inbee-park-off-course.html', 'snippet': 'Inbee Park of South Korea, who is seeking her fourth major title of the season, carded a one-over 73 in the second round of the Women’s British Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. ANDREWS, Scotland — The storm passed through Friday morning, leaving puddles in its wake. The wind arrived later and tilted the Old Course in favor of the early starters. Inbee Park, who played in the afternoon in the toughest of the conditions, managed to identify the rainbow even as the clouds rolled in and darkened her path to history.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/sports/Y-LPGA/Y-LPGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/03/sports/Y-LPGA/Y-LPGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/sports/Y-LPGA/Y-LPGA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/sports/Y-LPGA/Y-LPGA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1386, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/sports/Y-LPGA/Y-LPGA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag