of the former Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi’s party talked of mass resignations to protest his prison sentence for tax fraud.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/03/world/europe/berlusconi-followers-threaten-fragile-truce-in-italy.html', 'snippet': 'Members of the former Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi’s party talked of mass resignations to protest his prison sentence for tax fraud.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Lawmakers from former Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi’s political party said Friday that they were prepared to resign en masse to protest Mr. Berlusconi’s definitive conviction for tax fraud, a move that would effectively sink the uneasy alliance supporting the government. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/italy/italy-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/03/world/italy/italy-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 690}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/italy/italy-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 891, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/italy/italy-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1987, 'width': 1728, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/world/italy/italy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/03/world/italy/italy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLa