'El-Naggar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fd54d7c9-ef45-5e6c-8f62-c49e5fd9c91f', 'word_count': 1057, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fd54d7c9-ef45-5e6c-8f62-c49e5fd9c91f'}, {'abstract': 'Instead of sailing against the elements, the crews of the America’s Cup are sailing a stranger race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/03/opinion/a-race-like-no-other.html', 'snippet': 'Instead of sailing against the elements, the crews of the America’s Cup are sailing a stranger race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To grasp the strangeness of the modern America’s Cup, once the world’s premier sailing competition, it is helpful to imagine a Kentucky Derby that occurs not annually but intermittently and involves different ridable quadrupeds — horses, zebras, camels, elephants — each time the event occurs. The winners choose the venue of the next race, and there are, inevitably, legal challenges of one sort or another along the way. Then the race is run, and the process begins all over again.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Race Like No Other', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Race Like No Other', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': "AMERICA'S CUP", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sailboats and Sailing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-03T01:26:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/92035b3e-c4c9-5b51-a1a8-b155a87177ae', 'word_count': 335, 'uri': 'nyt://article/92035b3e-c4c9-5b51-a1a8-b155a87177ae'}, {'abstract': 'A cloud of scandal has spread from the Republican incumbent Bob McDonnell to his would-be successor. Now a potential scandal threatens to distract the Democratic candidate’s campaign.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/03/us/clouds-spread-to-democratic-side-of-virginia-governors-race.html', 'snippet': 'A cloud of scandal has spread from the Republican incumbent Bob McDonnell to his would-be successor. Now a potential scandal threatens to distract the Democratic candidate’s campaign.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For months, the governor’s race in Virginia has unfolded beneath a cloud of scandal over the Republican incumbent that spread to his would-be Republican successor, Kenneth T. Cuccinelli II.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Clouds Spread to Democratic Side of Virginia Governor’s Race', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clouds Spread to Democratic Side of Virginia Governor’s Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Governors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gabriel, Trip', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Virginia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuccinelli, Kenneth T II', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McAuliffe, Terry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonnell, Robert F', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grassley, Charles E', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mayorkas, Alejandro', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Securities and Exchange Commission', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GreenTech Automotive Inc', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name'