566-eaa0a0068f55'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Alonso, who with his brother and then-wife, Alicia Alonso, began the Ballet Nacional de Cuba, was a dancer and teacher who mixed classical rigor with Latin physicality.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/03/arts/dance/fernando-alonso-a-founder-of-cuban-ballet-dies-at-98.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Alonso, who with his brother and then-wife, Alicia Alonso, began the Ballet Nacional de Cuba, was a dancer and teacher who mixed classical rigor with Latin physicality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fernando Alonso, a Cuban ballet master and teacher who teamed with his brother and his wife at the time, the ballet star Alicia Alonso, to found a dance company that gained international renown as the Ballet Nacional de Cuba, died on July 27 in Havana. He was 98.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/arts/alonso-obit-1/alonso-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 917, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/03/arts/alonso-obit-1/alonso-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 917}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/arts/alonso-obit-1/alonso-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/arts/alonso-obit-1/alonso-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2046, 'width': 1339, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/03/arts/alonso-obit-1/alonso-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSt