00’s.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/04/the-great-fredini-dreams-of-a-3d-sideshow-in-coney-island/', 'snippet': 'Fred Kahl, a magician, sword-swallower, stuntman and interactive designer, is making replicas of sideshow performers with a 3D printer, hoping to recreate in miniature a Coney Island of the early 1900’s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During his years as a member of the Coney Island Circus Sideshow, Fred Kahl, 48, performed as a magician, a sword-swallower, a stuntman who could hammer nails into his skull and light up lightbulbs with his bare hands, and an impresario who helped found the Burlesque at the Beach. That was when he acquired another name: the Great Fredini.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/cityroom-fredini/cityroom-fredini-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/cityroom-fredini/cityroom-fredini-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/cityroom-fredini/cityroom-fredini-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/cityroom-fredini/cityroom-fredini-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/cityroom-fredini/cityroom-fredini-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/04/nyregion/cityroom-fredini/cityr