'nyt://article/46ec28b3-10f5-5616-834a-04e9b991ba4b'}, {'abstract': 'The Vail International Dance Festival in Colorado includes performances ranging from ballet to street.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/arts/dance/the-vail-international-dance-festival-turns-25.html', 'snippet': 'The Vail International Dance Festival in Colorado includes performances ranging from ballet to street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VAIL, Colo. — The Vail International Dance Festival — this year celebrating its 25th anniversary — abounds in historic, daring and once-only conjunctions, partnerships, experiments. It seems only appropriate that hummingbirds and swallows are routinely seen during the early-evening walk from town, alongside a rushing stream, up to the Gerald R. Ford Amphitheater, that the open-air performances are surrounded by mountains, and that the walk back yields views of a night sky crowded with unusually large stars. This is my seventh summer visit here; I’ve learned to look forward to seeing wonders onstage and off. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/vail/vail-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 763, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/vail/vail-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 763}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/vail/vail-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 805, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/vail/vail-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1610, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None,