tsourced to China. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Price of ‘Made in China’', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Price Of ‘Made In China’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Steel and Iron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Verrazano-Narrows Bridge (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridges and Tunnels', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Environment', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Transportation Authority', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T01:03:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Navarro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Navarro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/50cbdc36-0a89-5176-a3b5-217da0647cbf', 'word_count': 674, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50cbdc36-0a89-5176-a3b5-217da0647cbf'}, {'abstract': 'With 9.9 million vehicles taking to the streets of Jakarta each workday, the daily commute can take a toll on stressed Indonesians.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/world/asia/hours-to-go-just-to-get-to-work.html', 'snippet': 'With 9.9 million vehicles taking to the streets of Jakarta each workday, the daily commute can ta