 the fervor she has brought to all her endeavors, she delivered some surprising news: the Web site would merge with Newsweek, a once-proud but struggling magazine brand.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/business/media/05newsweek-brownsf/05newsweek-brownsf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/business/media/05newsweek-brownsf/05newsweek-brownsf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 263, 'width': 395, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/business/media/05newsweek-brownsf/05newsweek-brownsf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/05/business/media/05newsweek-brownsf/05newsweek-brownsf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/business/media/05newsweek-brownsf/05newsweek-brownsf-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Last Temptation of Tina Brown', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Last Temptation of Tina Brown', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaufman, Leslie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Magazines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Haughney, Christine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Tina', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N