r plans will not be easy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/nyregion/health-care-law-raises-pressure-on-public-employees-unions.html', 'snippet': 'The so-called Cadillac tax inserted into the Affordable Care Act will tax expensive health insurance plans like those obtained by powerful unions, and switching to cheaper plans will not be easy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cities and towns across the country are pushing municipal unions to accept cheaper health benefits in anticipation of a component of the Affordable Care Act that will tax expensive plans starting in 2018.\xa0', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Care Law Raises Pressure on Public Unions', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Care Law Raises Pressure On Public Unions', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Employees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organized Labor', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Local Government', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Boston (Mass)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T02:28:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_m