web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/nyregion/for-decades-fighting-to-rescue-a-bronx-park-from-disrepair.html', 'snippet': 'A group formed 33 years ago to clean up Playground 52 still faces a decrepit infrastructure that it says represents a disparity in city parks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thirty-three years ago, Al Quiñones and his friends adopted Playground 52 in the South Bronx, determined to save their neighborhood park from the blight that surrounded it. Working out of a bathroom that doubled as their office, they cadged paint, garbage cans and anything else they could rustle up in their relentless mission to improve their Longwood neighborhood. They called themselves 52 People for Change.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/nyregion/SIDESTREET/SIDESTREET-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/05/nyregion/SIDESTREET/SIDESTREET-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/nyregion/SIDESTREET/SIDESTREET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/nyregion/SIDESTREET/SIDESTREET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1446, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/nyregion/SIDESTREET/SIDESTREET-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/05/nyregion/SIDESTREET/SIDESTREET-thumbStandard