ename': None, 'lastname': 'Newman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f47f0ad-be34-5398-8d4f-24b8c6e319a1', 'word_count': 762, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f47f0ad-be34-5398-8d4f-24b8c6e319a1'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Stewart wanted a bicycle he could use during cold Massachusetts winters. He has ended up riding his Elf bicycle-car from North Carolina to Cambridge, Mass., this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/navigating-the-greenway-1200-miles-journey-in-an-electric-bicycle-car/', 'snippet': 'Mark Stewart wanted a bicycle he could use during cold Massachusetts winters. He has ended up riding his Elf bicycle-car from North Carolina to Cambridge, Mass., this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mark Stewart is a bike guy. But Mr. Stewart, a 65-year-old bicycle enthusiast, likes his car, too. By his way of thinking, he can keep his beloved yellow 1998 Saab convertible for a longer time if he rides his bike more. Simple math, he says: drive the car less, and it’ll last longer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/automobiles/wheels/ELF-luggage/ELF-luggage-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/02/automobiles/wheels/ELF-luggage/ELF-luggage-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/automobiles/wheels/ELF-luggage/ELF-luggage-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/02/automobiles/wheels/ELF-luggage/ELF-luggage-superJumbo.jpg', 'he