 associates of John C. Liu for participating in an illegal fund-raising scheme, the New York City Campaign Finance Board voted on Monday to withhold as much as $3.5 million in public money from his mayoral campaign.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/nyregion/Y-liu1/Y-liu1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Citing Irregularities, City Board Rejects Public Money for Liu’s Campaign', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Citing Irregularities, City Board Rejects Public Money for Liu’s Campaign', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Liu, John C', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chen, David W', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Campaign Finance Board (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T15:23:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56a409e8-7e98-526d-b7cb-ea9b7f8050b5', 'word_count': 920, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56a409e8-7e98-526d-b7cb-ea9b7f8050b5'}, {'abstract': '“Bob Dylan: Face Value,” an exhibition of 12 pastel portraits made by the iconoclastic singer-songwriter, will be the first show of his work at a British museum.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/portraits-by-bob-dylan-to-be-shown-at-londons-national-portrait-gallery/', 'snippet': '“Bob Dylan: Face Value,” an exhibition of 12 pastel portraits made by the iconoclastic singer-songwriter, will be the first show of his work at a British museum.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bob Dylan told us that everything would be different when he painted his masterpiece, but for this iconoclastic singer-songwriter, creating artwork and having it shown at internationally regarded institutions is becoming an increasingly regular experience. On Monday, the National Portrait Gallery in London became the latest museum — and the first ever in Britain — to announce that it will devote to Mr. Dylan’s (non-musical) work. This exhibition, called “Bob Dylan: Face Value,” will open on Aug. 24 and will display 12 pastel portraits made by him, the museum said. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/dylan/dylan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 237, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/dylan/dylan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 237, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/dylan/dylan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/dylan/dylan-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/05/arts/dylan/dylan-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Portraits by Bob Dylan to Be Shown at London’s National Portrait Gallery', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dylan, Bob', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Portrait Gallery (London)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T15:43:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/266f3a5a-180e-5c58-b18a-1c6d1f18e5cb', 'word_count': 286, 'uri': 'nyt://article/266f3a5a-180e-5c58-b18a-1c6d1f18e5cb'}, {'abstract': 'The first single from the singer-songwriter’s new album, which premieres here, features contributions from Questlove of the Roots and Adele’s producer Eg White.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/listen-up-a-soulful-torch-song-from-the-brooklyn-vocalist-diane-birch/', 'snippet': 'The first single from the singer-songwriter’s new album, which premieres here, features contributions from Questlove of the Roots and Adele’s producer Eg White.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first song Diane Birch wrote for her forthcoming album, “Speak a Little Louder” (out Oct. 15), didn’t quite go as planned. “All the Love You Got” — which makes its world premiere here — is an irresistibly defiant, stirring anthem in the vein of Dusty Springfield and Diana Ross. But, “when I wrote this song, I was in the head space of the disco era, and early ’80s dance music,” explained the 30-year-old Brooklyn-based singer-songwriter. “It had a lot of Prince references, along with Madonna, Blondie and the music Nile Rodgers made with David Bowie. But then I realized it’s not a dance song — it had to be a ballad.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Listen Up | A Soulful Torch Song From the Brooklyn Vocalist Diane Birch', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Listen Up: Funky Tears', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Birch, Diane', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roots, The (Music Group)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Br