', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Rosenthal', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenthal', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7eaa53b2-3c62-5dd0-83ad-1ee086259e48', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7eaa53b2-3c62-5dd0-83ad-1ee086259e48'}, {'abstract': 'The reinsurance arm of Third Point, the hedge fund run by Daniel S. Loeb, disclosed on Monday that it is seeking to raise up to $370.6 million from its forthcoming initial public offering. That shows quick growth for the nearly two-year-old operation.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/third-point-reinsurance-fund-arm-seeks-up-to-370-6-million-in-i-p-o/', 'snippet': 'The reinsurance arm of Third Point, the hedge fund run by Daniel S. Loeb, disclosed on Monday that it is seeking to raise up to $370.6 million from its forthcoming initial public offering. That shows quick growth for the nearly two-year-old operat...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The reinsurance arm of Third Point, the hedge fund run by Daniel S. Loeb, disclosed on Monday that it was seeking to raise up to $370.6 million from its forthcoming initial public offering.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Third Point Reinsurance Fund Arm Seeks Up to $370.6 Million in I.P.O.', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I.P.O. Plans', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Initial Public Offerings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Loeb, Daniel S', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Third Point LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T20:07:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced'