-b302c701c565'}, {'abstract': 'Disney Channel said on Monday that about 13.5 million people had watched the beach party musical, which had its premiere on July 19.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/05/teen-beach-movie-gets-big-ratings-for-disney/', 'snippet': 'Disney Channel said on Monday that about 13.5 million people had watched the beach party musical, which had its premiere on July 19.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Teen Beach Movie” is a certified smash. Disney Channel said on Monday that about 13.5 million people had watched the beach party musical, which had its premiere on July 19. That total includes the number of viewers who watched it live (8.4 million) and a week’s worth of DVR playback viewing, a standard industry measuring stick. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Teen Beach Movie’ Gets Big Ratings for Disney', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Teen Beach Movie’ Gets Big Ratings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Disney Channel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T21:38:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c03a547-a464-59c3-98a2-0b36cc025059', 'word_count': 180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c03a547-a464-59c3-98a2-0b36cc025059'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Rodriguez was in the Yankees’ lineup on Monday night, and with an appeal almost certain, he could remain there for the rest of the season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/sports/baseball/rodriguez-back-and-batting-fourth-for-yankees.html', 'snippet': 'Alex Rodriguez was in the Yankees’ lineup on Monday night, and with an appeal almost certain, he could remain there for the rest of the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — Alex Rodriguez sat in the far corner of the Yankees clubhouse Monday afternoon, staring at a computer screen displaying video images of Chicago White Sox pitcher Jose Quintana, whom he would soon be facing. A mere 30 minutes had passed since Major League Baseball had announced Rodriguez was being suspended for 211 games in connection with its months-long doping investigation, but Rodriguez, the 38-year-old third baseman, appeared unfazed.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Return to the Lineup and a Fight to Stay', 'kicker': 'White Sox 8, Yankees 1', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Rodriguez, Suspended Animation: A Return to the Lineup and a Fight to Stay', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Alex', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chicago White Sox', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-05T21:39:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/411ff418-3a1f-508a-8d05-5cc26e0ff091', 'word_count': 990, 'uri': 'nyt://article/411ff418-3a1f-508a-8d05-5cc26e0ff091'}, {'abstract': 'In its latest edition, which featured Chick Corea, Herbie Hancock, Esperanza Spalding and Amir ElSaffar, the Newport Jazz Festival showed that even as it spotlights the music’s older guard, it’s eager to restock with the new.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/arts/music/festival-now-59-welcomes-several-generations.html', 'snippet': 'In its latest edition, which featured Chick Corea, Herbie Hancock, Esperanza Spalding and Amir ElSaffar, the Newport Jazz Festival showed that even as it spotlights the music’s older guard, it’s eager to restock with the new.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEWPORT, R.I. — The Newport Jazz Festival, which ended Sunday at Fort Adams State Park here, is 59 now. It had early brilliance followed by middle-age aesthetic confusion, edging into pop and smooth jazz. Over the last nine years, it has corrected its course, entering a new period of steadiness and dignity as it seeks a new framing of jazz — and of its own audience.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/Newport/Newport-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 592, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/Newport/Newport-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 592}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/Newport/Newport-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1010, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/Newport/Newport-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1082, 'width': 1097, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non