ate-summer outdoor dining experiences, from the backyard to the park.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/t-magazine/modern-picnic-wares-for-photo-worthy-alfresco-dining.html', 'snippet': 'These artisanal products will upgrade late-summer outdoor dining experiences, from the backyard to the park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Too often, picnic wares are an afterthought — cheap wicker baskets, plastic gingham blankets, throwaway utensils. Of course, the primary attractions of do-it-yourself alfresco dining are a lavish spread, a natural setting and good company. But now, thanks to a handful of artisans, there are attractive, handcrafted goods for a decidedly modern (and Instagram-friendly) outdoor culinary experience.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Modern Picnic Wares for Photo-Worthy Alfresco Dining', 'kicker': 'By Design', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-06T04:00:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TDesign', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erica Bellman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bellman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60fd4971-30af-5b93-be47-cf70c7138749', 'word_count': 57, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60fd4971-30af-5b93-be47-cf70c7138749'}, {'abstract': 'A Nielsen study affirmed the idea that Twitter chatter during prime-time shows can sometimes cause a “significant increase” in the ratings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/business/media/study-links-tv-viewership-and-twitter-conversations.html', 'snippet': 'A Nielsen study affirmed the idea that Twitter chatter during prime-time shows can sometimes cause a “significant increase” in the ratings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A first-of-its-kind study by Nielsen has affirmed what nearly everyone in the television industry already suspected: Twitter conversations sometimes do cause people to turn on the TV.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Study Links TV Viewership and Twitter Conversations', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Study Links TV Viewership And Twitter Conversations', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stelter, Brian', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nielsen Media Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ratings (Audience Measurement)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-06T04:01:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d72ed270-402c-515d-891b-d19c63bd3988', 'word_count': 321, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d72ed270-402c-515d-891b-d19c63bd3988'}, {'abstract': 'There are more effective ways to help homeowners with their taxes, but Congress has never shown an appetite for eliminating the deductibility of mortgage interest, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/the-sacrosanct-mortgage-interest-deduction/', 'snippet': 'There are more effective ways to help homeowners with their taxes, but Congress has never shown an appetite for eliminating the deductibility of mortgage interest, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bruce Bartlett held senior policy roles in the Reagan and George H.W. Bush administrations and served on the staffs of Representatives Jack Kemp and Ron Paul. He is the author of the forthcoming book “The Benefit and the Burden: Tax Reform – Why We Need It and What It Will Take.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Sacrosanct Mortgage Interest Deduction', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Home Equity Loans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Credits, Deductions and Exemptions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-06T04:01:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Bartlett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bartlett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a17fec7-39bd-539a-887a-a3a0334c1c80', 'word_count': 1086, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a17fec7-39bd-539a-887a-a3a0334c1c80'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 85 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/word-of-the-day-altruistic/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 85 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'altruistic •\\ˌal-trü-ˈis-tik\\• adjective', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day | altruistic', '