y Warhol Museum in Pittsburgh, along with the video network EarthCam, began a live video feed of the artist’s final resting place, to commemorate his birthday. Warhol, who died in 1987, would have been 85 on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/06artsbeat-warhol/06artsbeat-warhol-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/06artsbeat-warhol/06artsbeat-warhol-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/06artsbeat-warhol/06artsbeat-warhol-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 754, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/06artsbeat-warhol/06artsbeat-warhol-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 754, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/06artsbeat-warhol/06artsbeat-warhol-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/06/arts/06artsbeat-warhol/06artsbeat-warhol-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'On Warhol’s Birthday, a Live Video Feed Streams From His Grave', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings and Downloads', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warhol, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major'