 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-06T20:35:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'RealEstate', 'section_name': 'Real Estate', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marcelle Sussman Fischler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marcelle', 'middlename': 'Sussman', 'lastname': 'Fischler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1834f4e9-4bf2-5da3-b53b-fc08b74f22a8', 'word_count': 523, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1834f4e9-4bf2-5da3-b53b-fc08b74f22a8'}, {'abstract': 'The director Mary Zimmerman takes an understated approach in her retelling of “The Jungle Book,” adapted from the Disney movie (and Kipling), at the Goodman Theater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/07/theater/reviews/the-jungle-book-opens-at-the-goodman-theater.html', 'snippet': 'The director Mary Zimmerman takes an understated approach in her retelling of “The Jungle Book,” adapted from the Disney movie (and Kipling), at the Goodman Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — The flora and fauna of India shimmer with eye-filling allure in the inventive new stage adaptation of “The Jungle Book,” having its premiere at the Goodman Theater here. Adapted from the Disney movie (based on the Rudyard Kipling stories) and directed by Mary Zimmerman, this modestly scaled and refreshingly spectacle-free family musical seeks to kindle children’s imaginations by softly blurring the line between man and beast, relying on the talents of designers and performers to create illusions rather than dazzling the senses with elaborate effects. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 474, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 474}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1617, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/07/arts/07JUNGLEBOOK/07JUNGLEBOOK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Indian Music Meets Jazz in Kipling’s Wild World', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Indian Music Meets Jazz In Kipling’s Wild World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goodman Theater', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zimmerman, Mary', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kipling, Rudyard', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sherman, Robert', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Jungle Book (Play)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gattelli, Christopher', 'r