24, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6cf9927-a4e8-5bd2-8467-71112b534696'}, {'abstract': 'Despite winning the right in some states to marry, not all gay couples want to. Not everyone accepts that.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/06/booming/how-should-gay-couples-fend-off-pressure-to-marry.html', 'snippet': 'Despite winning the right in some states to marry, not all gay couples want to. Not everyone accepts that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every other Tuesday, Steven Petrow, the author of “Steven Petrow’s Complete Gay & Lesbian Manners” (Workman, 2011), addresses questions about gay and straight etiquette for a boomer-age audience. Send questions for Civil Behavior to stevenpetrow@earthlink.net.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/booming/06civil-booming-marriage3/06civil-booming-marriage3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 823, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/06/booming/06civil-booming-marriage3/06civil-booming-marriage3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 823}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/booming/06civil-booming-marriage3/06civil-booming-marriage3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 747, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/booming/06civil-booming-marriage3/06civil-booming-marriage3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1494, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/06/booming/06civil-booming-marriage3/06civil-booming-marriage3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbSta