 awkward for the Clinton family. Hillary Rodham Clinton’s close aide Huma Abedin is married to one of the contenders, Anthony D. Weiner, who has been damaged by his admission that he had a habit of sending sexually explicit messages and pictures to women over the Internet. And in all, Bill Clinton says, five people the family counts as friends are in the running for mayor.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mayoral Race Is Awash With Clintons’ Friends', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Clintons’ Friends\r\nAbound in Race', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kaplan, Thomas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Bill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Catsimatidis, John A', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'de Blasio, Bill', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Weiner, Anthony D', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Abedin, Huma', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-06T20:43:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Kaplan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kaplan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/02ac863c-e10d-504e-b92d-178c2799687a', 'word_count': 239, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02ac863c-e10d-504e-b92d-178c2799687a'}, {'abstract': 'Photos from Sudan, India, Pakistan and Argentina.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013