r point, but more broadly. Reading his post, I had some further thoughts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Year of Living Stupidly', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-07T15:42:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9eecf8e1-b397-5258-83ca-f82be1d696de', 'word_count': 483, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9eecf8e1-b397-5258-83ca-f82be1d696de'}, {'abstract': 'A selection of sample test questions from the 2013 ELA/Literacy Common Core tests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/08/08/nyregion/sample-questions-document.html', 'snippet': 'A selection of sample test questions from the 2013 ELA/Literacy Common Core tests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A selection of sample test questions from the 2013 ELA/Literacy Common Core tests.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Annotated English State Test Questions for Grades 3-8', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-07T15:46:42+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'New York', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/a3121f10-752c-5354-b29c-0866d6d95222', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/a3121f10-752c-5354-b29c-0866d6d95222'}, {'abstract': 'A purveyor of over-the-counter medications creates prime display space for his wares, even in the most crowded drugstores.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/08/business/smallbusiness/how-urgentrx-crashed-the-party-at-the-cash-register.html', 'snippet': 'A purveyor of over-the-counter medications creates prime display space for his wares, even in the most crowded drugstores.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The checkout line in Duane Reade drugstores encompasses some of the most coveted real estate in New York. Within a five-foot radius of the cash register, dozens of the biggest brands in the world vie for attention from hooks, racks and shelves, every inch of which have been allocated according to the product’s place in the retail pecking order.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/business/08sbiz-sub/08sbiz-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/08/business/08sbiz-sub/08sbiz-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/business/08sbiz-sub/08sbiz-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/business/08sbiz-sub/08sbiz-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/business/08sbiz-sub/08sbiz-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/08