are rare in Morocco against King Mohammed VI, but since late last week activists and news outlets have documented the outcry on YouTube and Twitter against a mistaken pardon, later retracted, of a convicted child rapist.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/07/protests-in-morocco-after-king-pardons-spanish-pedophile/', 'snippet': 'Demonstrations are rare in Morocco against King Mohammed VI, but since late last week activists and news outlets have documented the outcry on YouTube and Twitter against a mistaken pardon, later retracted, of a convicted child rapist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Protests have roiled major cities in Morocco after the country’s king recently pardoned a Spanish pedophile. The demonstrations have persisted since late last week even after the king later retracted the mistaken pardon of the convicted child rapist, Daniel Galván Viña, 63, and he was arrested again in Spain this week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Protests in Morocco After King Pardons Spanish Pedophile', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Amnesties, Commutations and Pardons', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Juan Carlos I, King of Spain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mohammed VI', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Interpol (International Criminal Police Organization)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizat