nd swatching phase, they mix and match fabric samples with sketches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 50 (well, not 50) shades of green tacked to the wall of the Veronica Beard showroom on West 17th Street looked for an instant like the fixings for a leafy garden salad. Minute fabric swatches, they were pinned in tidy rows to a slab of slate-tone fiberboard, where they formed the understated counterpoint to a lineup of nautical stripes, fluorescent-bright daisies and eye-popping leopard spots.', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/fashion/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/08/fashion/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/fashion/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/fashion/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/fashion/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/08/fashion/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN/08COUNTDOWN3_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '