8/08/electric-stream-flow-designing-the-bmw-i3/', 'snippet': 'BMW undoubtedly knew that it would have to start from scratch with the design of its electric i3 platform; putting batteries and motors onto a gasoline platform would not have been enough.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To develop an electric vehicle with the sporty performance expected of the Ultimate Driving Machine, BMW undoubtedly knew that it would have to do more than simply slap motors and batteries into an existing model. So they designed an entirely new platform with a singular shape, made from innovative materials.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/automobiles/wheels/BMW-i3-1/BMW-i3-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/08/automobiles/wheels/BMW-i3-1/BMW-i3-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/automobiles/wheels/BMW-i3-1/BMW-i3-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/automobiles/wheels/BMW-i3-1/BMW-i3-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1154, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/08/automobiles/wheels/BMW-i3-1/BMW-i3-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/08/automobiles/wheels/BMW-i3-1/BMW-i3-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': '