https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/08/market-report-strappy-flats-for-every-type/', 'snippet': 'The all-purpose shoe of the season is best in black but comes in a variety of styles to fit any attitude.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A crop of black, closed-toed, strappy flats — the pointy-toed big sisters to Mary Janes and T-strap sandals — is popping up to carry late-summer wardrobes into cooler fall temperatures. From patent leather (Casadei and Jimmy Choo) to suede (Armani) to lace (Erdem) to studs (Freda Salvador), there’s a style for everyone. And for the truly bold, there are even crystals (Tabitha Simmons) for a little extra vamp.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Market Report | Strappy Flats for Every Type', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shoes and Boots', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ARMANI, GIORGIO', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kirkwood, Nicholas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Armani, Giorgio, SpA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Choo, Jimmy, Ltd', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-08T19:20:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dee5077f-f6ba-5634-8a77-e209da82a2cc', 'word_count': 71, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dee5077f-f6ba-5634-8a77-e209da82a2cc'}, {'abstract': 'Scientists have found that rituals performed around food actually influence the way the food is enjoyed. We all have our food rituals -- from splitting apart the oreo cookie to folding