conditions like attention deficit disorder.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/09/health/sharp-rise-among-young-in-emergency-care-after-stimulant-use.html', 'snippet': 'Federal health officials said the increase was fresh evidence of the unexpected consequences that can result from the wide use of medicines for conditions like attention deficit disorder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The number of young adults who end up in the emergency room after taking Adderall, Ritalin or other such stimulants has quadrupled in recent years, federal health officials said Thursday, fresh evidence of the unexpected consequences that can result from the wide use of medicines for conditions like attention deficit disorder.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Sign of Stimulants’ Toll on Young ', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Sign of Stimulants’ Toll on Young', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Substance Abuse and Mental Health Services Administration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tavernise, Sabrina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Attention Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emergency Medical Treatment', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-08T21:28:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sabrina Tavernise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sabrina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tavernise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0f5c2bc8-1aac-5b32-88fd-e2658134f36a', 'word_count': 427, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0f5c2