icist and a five-time “Jeopardy!” champion.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opponents in New Jersey Senate Race Struggle to Match Booker’s Star Power', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Opponents in New Jersey Senate Race Struggle to Match Booker’s Star Power', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zernike, Kate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Booker, Cory A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holt, Rush D Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Oliver, Sheila Y', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pallone, Frank Jr', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-09T00:43:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kate Zernike', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zernike', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/597033e6-3c66-5bf8-9bea-9d09911a3c71', 'word_count': 1105, 'uri': 'nyt://article/597033e6-3c66-5bf8-9bea-9d09911a3c71'}, {'abstract': 'In the comedy “I Give It a Year,” Rose Byrne and Rafe Spall are newlyweds whose family and friends are convinced that they won’t last.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/09/movies/i-give-it-a-year-a-comedy-by-dan-mazer.html', 'snippet': 'In the comedy “I Give It a Year,” Rose Byrne and Rafe Spall are newlyweds whose family and friends are convinced that they won’t last.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “I Give It a Year,” a smutty script and a passel of objectionable characters form an imperfect rom-com union — one that will, with any luck, fade from the mind long before its title suggests.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/arts/09RDP_IGIVE_SPAN/0809FILM05-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mismatch in Every Possible Way', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I Give It a Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Spall, Rafe', 'ran