at Al Qaeda could have used WikiLeaks disclosures, including classified United States government materials provided by Private Manning, to encourage attacks in the West, in testimony meant to show the harm done by his actions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Witness in Manning Case Says Leaks Could Help Al Qaeda', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Witness in Manning Case Says Leaks Could Help Al Qaeda', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manning, Bradley E', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Huetteman, Emmarie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Aboul-Enein, Youssef', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AL QAEDA', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WikiLeaks', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'bin Laden, Osama', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lind, Denise R', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-09T00:53:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emmarie Huetteman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emmarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Huetteman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0ad6c226-62db-5cba-9809-0f242bcf470b', 'word_count': 635, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0ad6c226-62db-5cba-9809-0f242bcf470b'}, {'abstract': 'Jim Furyk and Adam Scott posted rounds of 65 to share the lead after the first day of the P.G.A. Championship at Oak Hill Country Club in Pittsford, N.Y.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/09/sports/golf/low-key-furyk-and-sizzling-scott-tame-oak-hill.html', 'snippet': 'Jim Furyk and Adam Scott posted rounds of 65 to share the lead after the first day of the P.G.A. Championship at Oak Hill Country Club in Pittsford, N.Y.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSFORD, N.Y. — In a voice as expressive as an air conditioner’s hum, Jim Furyk said he felt really in control of his game and was pleased with his play Thursday at the P.G.A. Championship. Furyk posted a five-under-par 65 at Oak Hill Country Club on a course softened by a predawn thunderstorm and left defenseless by the disappearance of its bodyguard breezes.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/sports/Y-GOLF-1/Y-GOLF-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/09/sports/Y-GOLF-1/Y-GOLF-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/sports/Y-GOLF-1/Y-GOLF-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/sports/Y-GOLF-1/Y-GOLF-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/sports/Y-GOLF-1/Y-GOLF-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail