d-e0b2-5285-a51a-aca7b57b921e'}, {'abstract': 'Joseph J. Lhota, former chairman of the Metropolitan Transportation Authority, was the first Republican candidate for mayor this year to campaign at Muslim gatherings.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/09/nyregion/lhota-courts-muslim-votes.html', 'snippet': 'Joseph J. Lhota, former chairman of the Metropolitan Transportation Authority, was the first Republican candidate for mayor this year to campaign at Muslim gatherings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Prayer mats, pointing in the direction of Mecca, lined a pedestrian plaza and an entire block on 73rd Street in Jackson Heights, Queens, early on Thursday to mark the end of a month of fasting for Muslims and the beginning of a three-day feast that is traditionally spent in the company of close family and friends. Colored flag streamers hung along the sides of the streets, recycled boxes were circulated through the crowd to collect donations and hundreds of men took their shoes off and stood side by side to pray.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/nyregion/09ttg-lhota/09ttg-lhota-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/09/nyregion/09ttg-lhota/09ttg-lhota-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/nyregion/09ttg-lhota/09ttg-lhota-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/nyregion/09ttg-lhota/09ttg-lhota-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank'