nd Pakistan-administered portions of Kashmir, rushed into a cave-like bunker dug into the gentle slope of the village mountain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 766, 'width': 1181, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/09/world/asia/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk/9-Kashmir-LOC-IndiaInk-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fear Stalks Villages on Kashmir Border', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '',