08/11/theater/rattlestick-oversees-lucy-thurbers-five-play-cycle.html', 'snippet': 'With the involvement of other theaters in the West Village, Rattlestick Playwrights Theater is setting the stage for the simultaneous production of a five-play cycle by Lucy Thurber.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rattlestick Playwrights Theater is kicking off a festival devoted to the playwright Lucy Thurber this month, but the project was a long time coming. The company’s artistic director, David Van Asselt, traces its roots all the way back to ancient Greece. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/arts/11THURBER1_SPAN/11THURBER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/11/arts/11THURBER1_SPAN/11THURBER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/arts/11THURBER1_SPAN/11THURBER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/arts/11THURBER1_SPAN/11THURBER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/arts/11THURBER1_SPAN/11THURBER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/11/arts/11THURBER1_SPAN/11THURBER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/0