ancs, or about $38,000, while she was shopping at a luxury store in Switzerland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Oprah Winfrey, one of the most famous television personalities and wealthiest women in the United States, walked into a luxury store in Zurich last month, she spied an expensive Tom Ford crocodile handbag in a locked case. The price: 35,000 Swiss francs, or the equivalent of about $38,000.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oprah Winfrey and the Handbag She Couldn’t Have', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Luxury Goods', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ford, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stanley, Alessandra', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turner, Tina', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Winfrey, Oprah', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Forbes Magazine', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hermes International SA', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Zurich (Switzerland)', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-09T19:07:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christine Hauser', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hauser', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62ccb7de-dbdf-5a96-b45f-136acc219b80', 'word_c