resident Obama heads to Martha’s Vineyard on Saturday, stealing a week’s vacation before dealing with looming deadlines for the budget, among other pressing issues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/10/us/politics/amid-domestic-deadlines-and-global-crises-obama-begins-a-shorter-break.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama heads to Martha’s Vineyard on Saturday, stealing a week’s vacation before dealing with looming deadlines for the budget, among other pressing issues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama headed off to Martha’s Vineyard on Saturday for his family’s almost-annual August vacation, toting the usual baggage of unrelenting global crises but stealing a week’s break before dealing with looming deadlines for the budget, his health care law and the appointment of a new Federal Reserve chairman. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Amid Domestic Deadlines and Global Crises, Obama Begins a Shorter Break', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amid Domestic Deadlines and Global Crises, Obama Begins a Shorter Break', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Calmes, Jackie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': "Martha's Vineyard (Mass)", 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-10T02:24:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jackie Calmes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jackie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Calmes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9775cd2f-ea24-57c3-99da-dc77472