990dac583'}, {'abstract': 'Mark Sanchez’s knack for committing costly turnovers resurfaced. Geno Smith, also competing for the Jets’ starting quarterback job, injured an ankle but said he would be fine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/10/sports/football/sanchez-throws-for-two-touchdowns-one-for-each-team.html', 'snippet': 'Mark Sanchez’s knack for committing costly turnovers resurfaced. Geno Smith, also competing for the Jets’ starting quarterback job, injured an ankle but said he would be fine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT — In evaluating Mark Sanchez, Rex Ryan has vowed that he is capable of ignoring the recent past — all the turnovers and the bewildering mistakes — and focusing squarely on the present. If so, there couldn’t have been any way, none at all, that Ryan endured any flashbacks Friday on the Jets’ fourth offensive play of the preseason, a screen that Sanchez would have executed perfectly had the man who caught it, Ezekiel Ansah, not played for the Detroit Lions.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/10/sports/CITY-JETS-1/CITY-JETS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 373, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/10/sports/CITY-JETS-1/CITY-JETS-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 373}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/10/sports/CITY-JETS-1/CITY-JETS-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 636, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/10/sports/CITY-JETS-1/CITY-JETS-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1272, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'c