ike Joe Gnome, which is modeled after Manager Joe Maddon, are the biggest draw for fans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/11/sports/baseball/rays-try-to-promote-way-out-of-attendance-skid.html', 'snippet': 'Despite the Rays’ success, giveaways like Joe Gnome, which is modeled after Manager Joe Maddon, are the biggest draw for fans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. — In their endless quest to get more people to show up for their games, the Tampa Bay Rays recently announced that they were revisiting one of their most popular fan giveaways: a figurine of Manager Joe Maddon dressed as a gnome.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/sports/DOG-rays2/DOG-rays2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/11/sports/DOG-rays2/DOG-rays2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/sports/DOG-rays2/DOG-rays2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/sports/DOG-rays2/DOG-rays2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/11/sports/DOG-rays2/DOG-rays2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/11/sports/DOG-rays2/DOG-rays2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit