 took in an estimated $30.5 million over the weekend. That’s a solid total, but the studio, which has had a rough summer at the box office, had hoped that the film would deliver opening-weekend ticket sales of $35 million to $40 million.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Elysium’ Tops Weekend Box Office', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Elysium’ Tops Weekend Box Office', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blomkamp, Neill', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Damon, Matt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Foster, Jodie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hollywood.com', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-11T17:10:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7e8b8d70-bdab-53d5-9744-aa1e5ad8323a', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7e8b8d70-bdab-53d5-9744-aa1e5ad8323a'}, {'abstract': 'Lon Snowden, Edward J. Snowden’s father, and the family’s lawyer indicated they would encourage a return to the United States, but only if acceptable trial conditions could be negotiated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/12/us/snowdens-father-says-he-will-visit-son-in-russia.html', 'snippet': 'Lon Snowden, Edward J. Snowden’s father, and the family’s lawyer indicated they would encourage a return to the United States, but only if acceptable trial conditions could be negotiated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Edward J. Snowden’s father and the family’s