ri': 'nyt://article/ca2001e6-243d-542f-8863-3c5cbaa369a2'}, {'abstract': 'It is important for the technology industry to create technical standards and for companies to cross-license patents to each other.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/12/opinion/a-veto-of-an-import-ban.html', 'snippet': 'It is important for the technology industry to create technical standards and for companies to cross-license patents to each other.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Obama administration did the right thing earlier this month when it vetoed the decision by a little-known federal agency to ban the import of certain older-model Apple iPhones and iPads that it determined had violated patents owned by Samsung Electronics.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Veto of an Import Ban', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Veto of an Import Ban', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Trade and World Market', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Electronics Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Inventions and Patents', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-12T01:21:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/563d5ae4-995f-5688-a753-0f8d68f9cf0c', 'word_count': 321, 'uri': 'nyt://article/563d5ae4-995f-5688-a753-0f8d68f9cf0c'}, {'abstract': 'Falling short again in a major, Jim Furyk was disappointed but not crestfallen. At 43, he realizes he has missed out on fun, even in victory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/12/sports/golf/furyk-learns-to-accept-loss-without-feeling-defeated.html', 'snippet': 'Falling short again in a major, Jim Furyk was disappointed but not crestfallen. At 43, he realizes he has missed out on fun, even in victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSFORD, N.Y. — All week, Jim Furyk was reminded that he had the lead at the United States Open last year and lost it. Not surprisingly, it was not his favorite subject.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1351, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/sports/PGA/PGA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'hea