oni and Driade. Now Crate and Barrel has asked her to envision an affordable home line with the prompt: “What would you do if you were having people over for dinner?” In response, Navone has designed all the components of her ideal dining room, from splotchy blue-and-white glazed plates to high-backed Windsor chairs to red steel hanging lights to a dining table with a tiled top and legs of reclaimed teak.\u2006', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '100', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Dining a la Carte With Paola Navone and Crate and Barrel', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Find: Dining à la Carte', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Navone, Paola', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Crate & Barrel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Driade', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-12T13:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pilar Viladas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pilar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Viladas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8d837a03-a2dc-5ee0-962b-e5a294aaa0ba', 'word_count': 95, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8d837a03-a2dc-5ee0-962b-e5a294aaa0ba'}, {'abstract': 'State Senator Daniel L. Squadron is a former aide to Senator Charles E. Schumer, who is making a rare appearance in a television commercial backing him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/13/nyregion/schumer-endorses-candidate-for-public-advocate.html', 'snippet': 'State Senator Daniel L. Squadron is a former aide to Senator Charles E. Schumer, who is making a rare appearance in a television commercial backing him.', 'le