eral judge on Monday ruled that the stop-and-frisk practices of the New York Police Department in recent years violated the constitutional rights of New Yorkers by targeting young minority men for stops.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/08/12/nyregion/10-years-of-stop-and-frisk.html', 'snippet': 'A federal judge on Monday ruled that the stop-and-frisk practices of the New York Police Department in recent years violated the constitutional rights of New Yorkers by targeting young minority men for stops.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A federal judge on Monday ruled that the stop-and-frisk practices of the New York Police Department in recent years violated the constitutional rights of New Yorkers by targeting young minority men for stops.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/nyregion/0813-frisk-promo/0813-frisk-promo-jumbo.png', 'height': 195, 'width': 300, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/nyregion/0813-frisk-promo/0813-frisk-promo-superJumbo.png', 'height': 195, 'width': 300, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/nyregion/0813-frisk-promo/0813-frisk-promo-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/12/nyregion/0813-frisk-promo/0813-frisk-promo-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/12/nyregion/0813-frisk-promo/0813-frisk-promo-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {