ine': {'original': 'By Sophie Egan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sophie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Egan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c889a520-9919-54a5-a7f3-059f612f8dc1', 'word_count': 202, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c889a520-9919-54a5-a7f3-059f612f8dc1'}, {'abstract': 'The actress was a guest presenter at last night at MTV’s Teen Choice Awards, where she wore a sweet pink frock and a matching red lip.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/12/the-look-kerry-washington-seals-it-with-a-kiss/', 'snippet': 'The actress was a guest presenter at last night at MTV’s Teen Choice Awards, where she wore a sweet pink frock and a matching red lip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Girl: The actress, making headlines (and the cover of August’s Vanity Fair) for her increasingly popular personal style, was sweet as sugar in a pastel pink frock with an embroidered pattern of lips and hearts at the MTV Teen Choice Awards last night. Her own bright red kisser pulled the whole look together.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kerry Washington Seals It With a Kiss', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Washington, Kerry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MTV Networks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-12T19:41:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Edward Barsamian', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Edward', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barsamian', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f53d3a35-31bb-561e-a59a-ec02097f3705', 'word_count': 61, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f53d3a35-31bb-561e-a59a-ec02097f3705'}, {'abstract': 'More on Politico’s rise and the Washington Post’s decline.', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/12/this-town-and-its-newspapers/', 'snippet': 'More on Politico’s rise and the Washington Post’s decline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My Sunday column argued that the proper context for understanding how the Washington Post ended up passing from the Graham family to Jeff Bezos isn’t just the disruptive effects of the online revolution writ large. It’s also the more specific revolution wrought by the ex-Postie founders of Politico, who seized a market and an audience — obsessive political coverage for the political class\xa0—\xa0that had long belonged naturally to the Post, and that the Grahams’ newspaper clearly needed, and still needs, to compete successfully in the more nationalized and competitive media marketplace that the internet ushered in.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'This Town and Its Newspapers', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Allen, Mike', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bezos, Jeffrey P', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, John', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'VandeHei, Jim', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Politico, The', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Washington Post', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Maryland', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocat