ri': 'nyt://article/e5a58286-91c4-5589-b8ae-c409369171e9'}, {'abstract': 'A makeup artist for Giorgio Armani reveals how to create a smooth canvas for the face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/13/t-magazine/on-beauty-achieving-a-velvet-complexion.html', 'snippet': 'A makeup artist for Giorgio Armani reveals how to create a smooth canvas for the face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a runway season that was dominated by a bold stained lip and a heavily lined eye, one couldn’t help but take notice of the velvety, void-of-blush face that served as a canvas for these trends. Linda Cantello, the Giorgio Armani makeup artist who designed one of the best versions of the look in Milan, explains how to create this new porcelain take on the matte complexion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/t-magazine/25look-velvet/25look-velvet-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 201, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/t-magazine/25look-velvet/25look-velvet-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 201}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/t-magazine/25look-velvet/25look-velvet-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/t-magazine/25look-velvet/25look-velvet-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 503, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/t-magazine/25look-velvet/25look-velvet-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/201