one}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/33c0e350-1040-5269-bbc4-a893fba7b5bb', 'word_count': 722, 'uri': 'nyt://article/33c0e350-1040-5269-bbc4-a893fba7b5bb'}, {'abstract': 'Los Angeles is 38-8 since June 22. The Mets’ Jenrry Mejia allowed six hits and no walks in six innings, but he took the loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/13/sports/baseball/dodgers-rally-past-mets-for-sixth-straight-win.html', 'snippet': 'Los Angeles is 38-8 since June 22. The Mets’ Jenrry Mejia allowed six hits and no walks in six innings, but he took the loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — Jenrry Mejia’s pitches dipped and darted while he defanged the Los Angeles Dodgers — baseball’s best team the past month and a half — through the first five innings on Monday night. But like one of Mejia’s cut fastballs, the game took a sharp, swift turn as the Mets’ defense fell apart during a sloppy sixth.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/13/sports/13gamer-2/13gamer-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 475, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/13/sports/13gamer-2/13gamer-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 475}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/13/sports/13gamer-2/13gamer-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 810, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/13/sports/13gamer-2/13gamer-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1620, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/13/sports/13gamer-2/13gamer-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'wid