n the national conversation — turns out to have been at least partly staged, as five of the citizens whose shocked reactions were caught on hidden cameras had been cast in the roles, the Norwegian tabloid VG revealed on Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Norwegian Leader’s Not-So-Candid Camera', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stoltenberg, Jens', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Norway', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-13T22:29:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2111b5d4-ecbc-54e3-bd1d-83828388cbff', 'word_count': 397, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2111b5d4-ecbc-54e3-bd1d-83828388cbff'}, {'abstract': 'The accessories designer Anya Hindmarch says the time is ripe to reconsider antique pieces that come in the unfashionable shade.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/13/feeling-for-when-it-comes-to-furniture-brown-is-the-new-black/', 'snippet': 'The accessories designer Anya Hindmarch says the time is ripe to reconsider antique pieces that come in the unfashionable shade.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Brown furniture” as decorators derisively refer to it, is ripe for reconsideration: the best of the old stuff is beautifully made and shockingly well priced. While working with Ilse Crawford on our new Madison Avenue store, we came up with the concept of a “mash up” of Georgian furniture to display our bespoke lines. Handmade and old-school like my made-to-order leather goods, it made me wonder if “proper” antique furniture could once again become fashionable? ', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '123', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Feeling For | When It Comes to Furniture, Brown is the New Black', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lookout | This and That', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crawford, Ilse', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hindmarch, Anya', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madison Avenue (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-13T22:30:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anya Hindmarch', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hindmarch', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c98cffee-74b3-5f74-9d7c-d208adf9d474', 'word_count': 83, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c98cffee-74b3-5f74-9d7c-d208adf9d474'}, {'abstract': 'The move puts Steinway in a position to complete a deal with a rival bidder, believed to be Paulson & Company, which is said to have offered this week to buy the company for $38 a share, or about $475 million.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/08/13/kohlberg-declines-to-raise-bid-for-steinway/', 'snippet': 'The move puts Steinway in a position to complete a deal with a rival bidder, believed to be Paulson & Company, which is said to have offered this week to buy the company for $38 a share, or about $475 million.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A contest to buy the maker of Steinway & Sons pianos is ending in a diminuendo.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'head