ssion created by Gov. Andrew Cuomo should investigate the link between campaign contributions and legislation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/14/opinion/subpoenas-for-albany.html', 'snippet': 'A new commission created by Gov. Andrew Cuomo should investigate the link between campaign contributions and legislation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Andrew Cuomo of New York warned legislators earlier this year that if they failed to pass crucial reforms, including public financing of political campaigns, then he would establish a commission to investigate and subpoena public officials suspected of misconduct. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Subpoenas for Albany', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Subpoenas for Albany', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cuomo, Andrew M', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-14T01:12:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/2077822d-0b9a-5b05-9c09-684ccbd6c773', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2077822d-0b9a-5b05-9c09-684ccbd6c773'}, {'abstract': 'The Russian president is doing more harm at home than anywhere else.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/14/opinion/friedman-obama-snowden-and-putin.html', 'snippet': 'The Russian president is doing more harm at home than anywhere else.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You only get one chance to make a s