 Web sites and hookup apps.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/14/nyregion/vaccination-appears-to-have-halted-a-meningitis-outbreak.html', 'snippet': 'The infection spread among gay and bisexual men in New York City who met at parties, bars, clubs and through Web sites and hookup apps.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A bacterial meningitis outbreak among gay and bisexual men in New York City that had raised fears of a new AIDS-type epidemic has subsided after an aggressive vaccination campaign, leaving city health officials cautiously optimistic that it has been contained. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Vaccination Appears to Have Halted a Meningitis Outbreak', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Vaccination Appears to Have Halted a Meningitis Outbreak', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meningitis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vaccination and Immunization', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Health and Mental Hygiene Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mount Sinai Medical Center', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Gay Men's Health Crisis", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-14T01:20:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anemona Hartocollis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anemona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartocollis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0e79b813-e2e9-5e1b-b768-1d70a7532176', 'word_count': 555, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0e79b813-e2e9-5e1b-b768-1d70a7532176'}, {'abstract': 'The Food a