15e5-2867-5e78-bd5e-3205e69794a1', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/1b0a15e5-2867-5e78-bd5e-3205e69794a1'}, {'abstract': 'The Justice Department has learned an important lesson about putting on cases involving complex Wall Street financial machinations and has lined up a witness who can help explain its case to a jury.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/08/14/u-s-puts-a-helpful-face-on-its-fraud-case/', 'snippet': 'The Justice Department has learned an important lesson about putting on cases involving complex Wall Street financial machinations and has lined up a witness who can help explain its case to a jury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The so-called London Whale, whose trading in credit default swaps ended up costing JPMorgan Chase more than $6 billion in losses, appears to have a new role as the linchpin of the government’s criminal case against two employees of the bank. His cooperation shows that the Justice Department has learned an important lesson about putting on cases involving complex Wall Street financial machinations that are said to have involved fraud.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Puts a Helpful Face on Its Fraud Case', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Securities and Commodities Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grout, Julien', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Iksil, Bruno', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin-Artajo, Javier', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-14T19:57:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', '