-football.html', 'snippet': 'Texas A&M’s Johnny Manziel hasn’t always made good decisions since winning the Heisman Trophy last December, and strong action by the N.C.A.A. might be what he needs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Investigations into controversial autograph-signing sessions, from-the-hip tweets and general boorish behavior. Those are just some of the issues following Johnny Manziel, the Heisman Trophy winning quarterback from Texas A&M, this off-season. Manziel is just a sophomore, so it could be a kid acting like a kid. But maybe strong action by the N.C.A.A. will help him mature in a hurry.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video: Reining In Johnny Football', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Manziel, Johnny', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football (College)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Collegiate Athletic Assn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Heisman Trophy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-14T22:48:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'College Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By William C. Rhoden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Rhoden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50171397-23f7-51a9-b2e6-f30d505db08b', 'word_count': 60, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50171397-23f7-51a9-b2e6-f30d505db08b'}, {'abstract': 'If the sheer number of baby pinks and chalky blues on the fall runways was any indication, pastels will be making a big statement this fall.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2013/08/11/fashion/11browsinggraphic2.html', 'snippet': 'If the sheer number of baby pinks and chalky blues on the fall runways was any indication, pastels will be making a big statement this fall.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the sheer number of baby pinks and chalky blues on the fall runways was any indication, pastels will be making a big statement this fall.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fashion Tips on How to Wear Pastels', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-14T22:49:48+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Fashion & Style', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/1c11aef2-2905-5f45-98d5-3017eb6ba588', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/1c11aef2-2905-5f45-98d5-3017eb6ba588'}, {'abstract': 'Like macarons, without all the sugar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/fashion/fashion-tips-on-how-to-wear-fall-pastels.html', 'snippet': 'Like macarons, without all the sugar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the sheer number of baby pinks and chalky blues on the fall runways was any indication, pastels will be making a big statement this fall. At the Céline, Rochas and Carven shows, among many others, designers sent out a startling array of garments in colors straight out of the nursery. There were boxy pullovers, just-below-the-knee skirts and, most unexpectedly, all manner of coats — tailored, mannish and often oversize. But, come September, how do you pull off sugary pastels without looking like an artisanal ice cream sundae?', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/fashion/15BROWSE1_SPAN/15BROWSE1_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'h