to inform Americans about the ups, downs and twisty turns of their nation’s politics as a newspaper reporter, syndicated columnist and television pundit, died on Wednesday at his home in Charles Town, W.Va. He was 85.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 980, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 980}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 627, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1254, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/us/GERMOND-obit/GERMOND-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jack Germond, Political Reporter of the Old School, Dies at 85', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jack Germond, Political Reporter of the Old School, Dies at 85', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Douglas', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Germond, Jack W (1928-2013)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T02:42:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Douglas Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Douglas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/3531c527-73aa-5908-ad95-eaffa051b33b', 'word_count': 1198, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3531c527-73aa-5908-ad95-eaffa051b33b'}, {'abstract': 'Pakistani military officials said the Indian military had killed a civilian, the latest in a round of accusations of cross-border violations in the disputed region of Kashmir.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/world/asia/pakistan-says-indian-military-killed-a-civilian-in-kashmir.html', 'snippet': 'Pakistani military officials said the Indian military had killed a civilian, the latest in a round of accusations of cross-border violations in the disputed region of Kashmir.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pakistani military officials said the Indian military killed a civilian, the latest in a round of accusations of cross border violations in the disputed region of Kashmir, which the two countries claim in its entirety. Tensions flared over the last week as the relative calm over the Line of Control, the border that divides Kashmir, was broken after each side accused the other of breaking a 2003 cease-fire. A Pakistani military official said the civilian was killed by Indian shelling Tuesday night in Pakistani-administered Kashmir. Prime Minister Nawaz Sharif of Pakistan on Wednesday stressed the need for more diplomacy to cool tensions on both sides. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pakistan Says Indian Military Killed a Civilian in Kashmir', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Asia', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pakistan Says Indians Killed a Civilian in Kashmir', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kashmir and Jammu (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T02:42:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Salman Masood', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Salman', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Masood', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/550fb8cc-bafe-5778-bf5a-15b634210c43', 'word_count': 105, 'uri': 'nyt://article/550fb8cc-bafe-5778-bf5a-15b634210c43'}, {'abstract': 'Alfonso Soriano drove in seven runs to help the Yankees beat the Angels for their fourth straight victory and give their once-bleak playoff chances a jolt of life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/sports/baseball/coming-off-career-day-soriano-does-one-better.html', 'snippet': 'Alfonso Soriano drove in seven runs to help the Yankees beat the Ange