00', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Sternbergh, A.O. Scott and Stephanie Zacharek', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sternbergh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'A.', 'middlename': 'O.', 'lastname': 'Scott', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}, {'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zacharek', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1858ef3-7f56-5595-944b-11cb931b36a1', 'word_count': 1979, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1858ef3-7f56-5595-944b-11cb931b36a1'}, {'abstract': 'This time the director is making the movie he really wanted to make — and doing it on the cheap.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/magazine/can-peter-berg-redeem-himself-after-battleship.html', 'snippet': 'This time the director is making the movie he really wanted to make — and doing it on the cheap.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Peter Berg wanted me to box with him. “Come on, you’re a tough guy,” he said. I tried to disabuse him of that notion. I told him I’d been in only one fight in my adult life, and I lost that one.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/magazine/18berg1/mag-18Berg-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/18/magazine/18berg1/mag-18Berg-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/magazine/18berg1/mag-18Berg-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg',