2-57b2-ab71-229987ded559'}, {'abstract': 'Cisco Systems, the technology industry’s biggest maker of computer infrastructure equipment, said it planned to cut roughly 5 percent of its work force in an effort to trim costs and reorganize,', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/daily-report-cisco-to-cut-4000-jobs-despite-rising-revenue/', 'snippet': 'Cisco Systems, the technology industry’s biggest maker of computer infrastructure equipment, said it planned to cut roughly 5 percent of its work force in an effort to trim costs and reorganize,', 'lead_paragraph': 'Cisco Systems, the technology industry’s biggest maker of computer infrastructure equipment, said on Wednesday that it planned to cut 4,000 jobs, or roughly 5 percent of its work force, in an effort to trim costs and reorganize during what executives described as a “challenging” global economic climate, Jenna Wortham reports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-superJumbo-v3.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbStandard-v5.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-thumbLarge-v5.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Daily Report: Cisco to Cut 4,000 Jobs, Despite Rising Revenue', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cisco Systems Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T10:45:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0ef57e9-4c62-5a80-84f9-55089c313df1', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0ef57e9-4c62-5a80-84f9-55089c313df1'}, {'abstract': 'At first, the manufacturer’s leaders were devastated to learn that the company’s performance was so much worse than they had believed.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/running-the-numbers-a-business-reassesses-its-performance/', 'snippet': 'At first, the manufacturer’s leaders were devastated to learn that the company’s performance was so much worse than they had believed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of my clients is a specialty manufacturing company that makes a beauty product. The company has about 200 employees, and we started talking recently about the efficiency of its manufacturing plant. The company’s chief financial officer volunteered that he thought the company was running at an efficiency rate of 89 percent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Running the Numbers, a Business Reassesses Its Performance', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Factories and Manufacturing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T11:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Patrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patrick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8ec216ae-de19-59ea-92b3-751540e345f9', 'word_count': 644, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8ec216ae-de19-59ea-92b3-751540e345f9'}, {'abstract': 'I don’t know why I saved one calendar entry of the many given to me by my wife, a lover of pithy sayings. Perhaps it was the promise it showed: golden years shared with a loving companion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/booming/august-16-a-message-on-love.html', 'snippet': 'I don’t know why I saved one calendar entry of the many given to me by my wife, a lover of pithy sayings. Perhaps it was the promise it showed: golden years shared with a loving companion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The calendar entry for Tuesday, Aug. 16, 2011, reads simply, “Love One Another.” My wife, Terry, handed me the entry, a leaf torn from a pad, that morning. A drawing beneath the caption depicts a late middle-aged couple embracing as they walk down the beach, eyes sparkling, mouths agape, sharing a hearty laugh. The sun is setting behind them, throwing glitter across the water. Since Terry gave it to me nearly two years ago, that calendar page has remained on my desk in our bedroom, placed so that I see it every time I pass by.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 639, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1123, 'width': 1800, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/15/booming/15mystory-booming-menopause/15mystory-booming-menopause-thumbLarg