SIER', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58497907-0329-5b90-8219-6a47d30158a1', 'word_count': 22, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58497907-0329-5b90-8219-6a47d30158a1'}, {'abstract': 'In 2004, the year before he stepped away from his TV show, Dave Chappelle was in high demand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/arts/dave-chappelles-busy-2004.html', 'snippet': 'In 2004, the year before he stepped away from his TV show, Dave Chappelle was in high demand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dave Chappelle was something of a prodigy, starting in comedy clubs at 14, drawing glowing press and interest from Hollywood while still a teenager. He struggled to live up to his early buzz for almost a decade, but “Chappelle’s Show” on Comedy Central catapulted him to stardom. He completed only two seasons, but in 2004, the year before he left television, Mr. Chappelle had one of the most impressive years in comedy history. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 335, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE/18SUBSIDECHAPPELLE-thumbStan