some, it’ll be worth the price.', 'web_url': 'https://pogue.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/glasses-that-solve-colorblindness-for-a-big-price-tag/', 'snippet': 'Seeing all the colors of a rainbow, at a cost of $600? For some, it’ll be worth the price.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few weeks back, I wrote about special lenses that were developed to give doctors “a clearer view of veins and vasculature, bruising, cyanosis, pallor, rashes, erythema, and other variations in blood O2 level, and concentration,” especially in bright light.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Glasses That Solve Colorblindness, for a Big Price Tag', 'kicker': 'Pogue&#039;s Posts', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Color', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Color Blindness', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eyes and Eyesight', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sunglasses', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T19:41:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Pogue', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogue', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/848919a7-6b7e-5e62-9b96-87b3e8ab7496', 'word_count': 866, 'uri': 'nyt://article/848919a7-6b7e-5e62-9b96-87b3e8ab7496'}, {'abstract': 'Right-wing groups sent a letter to the Republican senator encouraging him to retire, or else face a primary challenge.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/tea-party-to-lamar-alexander-stop-compromising/', 'snippet': 'Right-wing groups sent a letter to the Republican senator encouraging him to retire, or else face a primary challenge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to flexing political muscle, Tea Party zealots don’t hesitate to be downright threatening, as in their warning to Senator Lamar Alexander, Republican of Tennessee that he’d better retire from office because “our great nation can no longer afford compromise and bipartisanship, two traits for which you have become famous.” The warning was in an open letter from a score of Tea Party groups, most of them county operations in the senator’s home state. They said he would face a right-wing primary challenge if he should opt to run next year for a third term.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tea Party to Lamar Alexander: Stop Compromising', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tea Party Movement', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALEXANDER, LAMAR', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T19:43:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Francis X. Clines', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Francis', 'middlename': 'X.', 'lastname': 'Clines', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e45467c8-893d-56ea-8f3c-36839ed7638f', 'word_count': 345, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e45467c8-893d-56ea-8f3c-36839ed7638f'}, {'abstract': 'Shirley and Dave Ziolkowski’s custom 1988 Dodge Shadow has helped the couple rekindle the cruising days of their youth.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/08/18/automobiles/18shadow-slides.html', 'snippet': 'Shirley and Dave Ziolkowski’s custom 1988 Dodge Shadow has helped the couple rekindle the cruising days of their youth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shirley and Dave Ziolkowski’s custom 1988 Dodge Shadow has helped the couple rekindle the cruising days of their youth.', 'source': 'The New Yor