': 'As the death toll continued to rise, supporters of Egypt’s deposed president, Mohamed Morsi, pointed to video of civilians being cut down by gunfire on Wednesday in Cairo during an assault by security forces on a sit-in.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/15/video-shows-civilians-gunned-down-in-cairo/', 'snippet': 'As the death toll continued to rise, supporters of Egypt’s deposed president, Mohamed Morsi, pointed to video of civilians being cut down by gunfire on Wednesday in Cairo during an assault by security forces on a sit-in.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Egyptians continue to count the dead on Thursday, one day after the military-installed government used deadly force to disperse protests, supporters of the deposed president, Mohamed Morsi, drew attention to video of civilians being cut down by gunfire during the assault on a sit-in near the Rabaa al-Adawiya mosque in Cairo.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Video Shows Civilians Gunned Down in Cairo', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morsi, Mohamed', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cairo (Egypt)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-15T21:48:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Mackey and Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mackey', 'qualifier': None, 'title'