e documentary “Herblock: The Black & the White” tells the life story of the editorial cartoonist Herbert Block.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/16/movies/herblock-the-black-the-white-about-herbert-block.html', 'snippet': 'The documentary “Herblock: The Black & the White” tells the life story of the editorial cartoonist Herbert Block.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The all-star lineup of journalists who appear in “Herblock: The Black and the White” concur that Herblock (the editorial cartoonist Herbert Block, who adopted that pen name), was a rare talent: an incisive satirist, a prescient judge of character, a wielder of a sure graphic line and a class act to boot. Michael Stevens’s laudatory documentary trumpets all these qualities, engaging in the very sort of mythologizing that its subject might have punctured in his heyday.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/arts/16FILMROUND6/0816FILMROUND06-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 916, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/16/arts/16FILMROUND6/0816FILMROUND06-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 916}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/arts/16FILMROUND6/0816FILMROUND06-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 671, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/arts/16FILMROUND6/0816FILMROUND06-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1342, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/arts/16FILMROUND6/16FILMROUND6-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'