f the first mass-market computers for consumers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/16/business/lewis-kornfeld-made-radio-shack-an-early-player-in-pcs-dies-at-97.html', 'snippet': 'In 1977, with Mr. Kornfeld as president, Radio Shack introduced the TRS-80, one of the first mass-market computers for consumers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lewis Kornfeld, who as president of Radio Shack helped the company become a major player in the early personal computer market in 1977 by releasing the TRS-80, one of the first mass-market and relatively affordable computers, died on Aug. 11 in Fort Worth. He was 97.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/business/kornfeld-obit-1/kornfeld-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 743, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/16/business/kornfeld-obit-1/kornfeld-obit-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 743}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/business/kornfeld-obit-1/kornfeld-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 828, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/business/kornfeld-obit-1/kornfeld-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1911, 'width': 1544, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/business/kornfeld-obit-1/kornfeld-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/16/business/kornfeld-obit-1/kornfeld-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh