 you before your lives changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As I pushed the wheelchair carrying my son down our neighborhood’s main street, a mini-van pulled up, the passengers waving. It was the same car I had passed while crossing the street two nights earlier. The driver had given me a familiar look — that sweet, half smile at our family’s misfortune — then, his face contorting, he looked again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Becoming the Parent With the Child in the Wheelchair', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Encephalitis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-16T15:43:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandra Joy Stein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sandra', 'middlename': 'Joy', 'lastname': 'Stein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3d971c5f-90c4-5560-bf52-0cc8211423f6', 'word_count': 777, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3d971c5f-90c4-5560-bf52-0cc8211423f6'}, {'abstract': 'Deborah Blum talks to Michael Mason, deputy science editor, about her new column.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/audio/2013/08/16/health/scitimes-podcast-poisonpen.html', 'snippet': 'Deborah Blum talks to Michael Mason, deputy science editor, about her new column.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Deborah Blum talks to Michael Mason, deputy science editor, about her new column.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Behind the Poison Pen', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name