 outsiders.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/08/16/bank-of-america-may-merge-merrill-lynch-with-parent/', 'snippet': 'The move would simplify Bank of America’s organization and reduce costs but would not be noticeable to most outsiders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bank of America is still trying to get its arms around the big acquisitions it did amid the financial crisis.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bank of America May Merge Merrill Lynch With Parent', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-16T19:04:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden and Peter Eavis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eavis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5145bc45-60f6-555e-ab4e-631ac3bed955', 'word_count': 464, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5145bc45-60f6-555e-ab4e-631ac3bed955'}, {'abstract': 'In 1978, Gay Cioffi and Mark Obenhaus had a summer fling in the Hamptons then lost touch. In 2012, they reconnected on Facebook and were married Aug. 3.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/fashion/weddings/a-love-embraced-some-35-years-later.html', 'snippet': 'In 1978, Gay Cioffi and Mark Obenhaus had a summer fling in the Hamptons then lost touch. In 2012, they reconnected on Facebook and were married Aug. 3.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anyone who has ever had one knows there is nothing quite like a perfect summer beach romance in the spring of life. But, like a great bottle of wine, once it is done it is done, its pleasures left only to memory. ', 'pr