ncisco Cervelli in the Biogenesis doping scandal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/17/sports/baseball/rodriguez-denies-report-that-his-associates-leaked-names.html', 'snippet': 'A report by the CBS news program “60 Minutes” cited two sources as saying that Alex Rodriguez implicated Ryan Braun and Francisco Cervelli in the Biogenesis doping scandal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOSTON — Alex Rodriguez arrived at Fenway Park on Friday to begin a three-game series against the Red Sox, bracing for an extended chorus of derision from Red Sox fans getting their first crack at him since baseball suspended him for 211 games. The punishment came after he was linked to a South Florida clinic that supplied players with performance-enhancing drugs.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 493, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 493}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 841, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1681, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/sports/17yankees/17yankees-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rodriguez Denies Implicating Others', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rodriguez Denies Implicating Others', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Waldstein, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Biogenesis of America LLC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Alex', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Braun, Ryan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cervelli, Francisco', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doping (Sports)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': '60 MINUTES (TV PROGRAM)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-16T19:13:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein and Steve Eder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Steve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4b615a7-e16f-5aef-bbce-bcea4a960317', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4b615a7-e16f-5aef-bbce-bcea4a960317'}, {'abstract': 'The International Contemporary Ensemble performs as part of the Mostly Mozart Festival this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/arts/music/fresh-pieces-crisp-players.html', 'snippet': 'The International Contemporary Ensemble performs as part of the Mostly Mozart Festival this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Among the many changes that the Mostly Mozart Festival has instituted in recent years to shore up intrigue and innovation, few have stood out as sharply as this season’s residency by the International Contemporary Ensemble. A reliably persuasive new-music group, the ensemble opens the week with fresh pieces by Felipe Lara and Tyshawn Sorey \xa0on Sunday, and by Maria Stankova and Nathan Davis \xa0on Monday.\xa0On Tuesday, the ensemble celebrates the 80th\xa0birthday of the maverick composer Pauline Oliveros, collaborating with her in a range of chamber works. A final offering\xa0on Thursday\xa0pairs a premiere by George Lewis with Beethoven’s Septet in E flat.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18GUIDE5/18GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18GUIDE5/18GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18GUIDE5/18GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/arts/18GUIDE5/18GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption':