get its weaknesses right.', 'web_url': 'https://douthat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/16/libertarian-populism-and-its-critics/', 'snippet': 'How critics underestimate the hot new right-of-center idea, and how they get its weaknesses right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Let me assume, one more time, the mantle of libertarian populism’s friendliest critic, and say something about the ongoing arguments that the concept has inspired. (The latest round-up includes Ben Domenech vs. Ezra Klein, Conn Carroll\xa0vs. Brian Beutler, Jonathan Chait vs. Will Wilkinson … and I could easily go on.) In particular, I’d like to address what seems like the core critique of the lib-pop idea, common to its left-wing, centrist and conservative critics alike, which is that it might call itself populist but it’s too, well, libertarian to ever be truly popular.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Libertarian Populism and Its Critics', 'kicker': 'Ross Douthat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Liberalism (US Politics)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libertarianism (US Politics)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Chait, Jonathan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Charles', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paul, Rand', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', '