 a Time in Mumbai Dobaara,” a young woman comes between an underworld kingpin and his protégé.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/17/movies/once-upon-a-time-in-mumbai-dobaara-a-gangster-sequel.html', 'snippet': 'In “Once Upon a Time in Mumbai Dobaara,” a young woman comes between an underworld kingpin and his protégé.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In “Once Upon a Time in Mumbai Dobaara,” Shoaib (an effective Akshay Kumar) is a gangster to his core: he looks the part — sunglasses, slicked-back hair, sleek suits — and has a firm grip on Mumbai’s underworld. The character’s rise was told in the action-packed 2010 movie “Once Upon a Time in Mumbai,” but for this sequel, Milan Luthria, who directed both, wanted to show that his villain has a heart. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/arts/17ONCEUPON/17ONCEUPON-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/17/arts/17ONCEUPON/17ONCEUPON-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/arts/17ONCEUPON/17ONCEUPON-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/arts/17ONCEUPON/17ONCEUPON-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1236, 'width': 1855, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/arts/17ONCEUPON/17ONCEUPON-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/17/arts/17ONCEUPON/17