count': 291, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b91b1dc-84c9-58ac-88a0-6e00d0c454ce'}, {'abstract': 'Supporters of  Silvio Berlusconi, the former prime minister, use billboards and banner-hauling planes to make their point, bringing politics to the air above beach resorts and inspiring a counteroffensive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/17/world/europe/as-berlusconis-party-supports-embattled-chief-critics-retaliate.html', 'snippet': 'Supporters of  Silvio Berlusconi, the former prime minister, use billboards and banner-hauling planes to make their point, bringing politics to the air above beach resorts and inspiring a counteroffensive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Posters in support of Silvio Berlusconi, the embattled former prime minister, are appearing on billboards and bus stops in major Italian cities and along highways. An aerial advertising blitz along Italy’s coastline was timed to coincide with Ferragosto, the sacrosanct mid-August holiday that sends Italians to the seaside.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Berlusconi’s Party Supports Embattled Chief, Critics Retaliate', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Berlusconi’s Party Supports Embattled Chief, Critics Retaliate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Italy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Berlusconi, Silvio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party (Italy)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'People of Liberty Party (Italy)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-16T23:23:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', '