{'abstract': 'A surprise factor in Atlanta’s runaway success, third baseman Chris Johnson has found his stride and is leading the National League in hitting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/sports/baseball/braves-johnson-exceeds-expectations.html', 'snippet': 'A surprise factor in Atlanta’s runaway success, third baseman Chris Johnson has found his stride and is leading the National League in hitting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Johnson was hitting .369 after the first month of the season, a torrid pace that did not match his ordinary track record. Before his first game in May, by his locker at Turner Field in Atlanta, Johnson tried to explain his sudden success.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/dogBASES1/dogBASES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 430, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/dogBASES1/dogBASES1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 430}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/dogBASES1/dogBASES1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/dogBASES1/dogBASES1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1466, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/dogBASES1/dogBASES1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/dogBASES1/dogBASES1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailh