y — a random, unweighted connection with someone you never knew existed and would surely never meet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/opinion/sunday/dear-emma.html', 'snippet': 'A pen-pal friendship is pure, conjured serendipity — a random, unweighted connection with someone you never knew existed and would surely never meet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I ARRIVED early. A stranger to Sydney, I was unsure how quickly I would find the bar she’d chosen, on the waterfront promenade below the Opera House.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-review/18PENPALS/18PENPALS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-review/18PENPALS/18PENPALS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-review/18PENPALS/18PENPALS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-review/18PENPALS/18PENPALS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-review/18PENPALS/18PENPALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-review/18PENPALS/18PENPALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sunday-rev