 is about hope.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/us/a-musical-switch-from-self-pity-to-gratitude.html', 'snippet': 'The new album by Blue October, “Sway,” is less about the specifics of a band member’s recovery from addiction to alcohol and prescription pills than it is about hope.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last May, Justin Furstenfeld’s pregnant wife offered him an ultimatum: drinking and drugs or their marriage. The next day Mr. Furstenfeld’s bandmates in the platinum-selling rock band Blue October came to his house in San Marcos and presented him with a similar choice. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25B', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/us/18ttCulture/18ttCulture-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 374, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/18/us/18ttCulture/18ttCulture-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 374}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/us/18ttCulture/18ttCulture-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 638, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/us/18ttCulture/18ttCulture-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1276, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/us/18ttCulture/18ttCulture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/18/us/18ttCulture/18ttCulture-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '