icle/c216fb75-9cc5-5332-b0c8-34c2ba35edd8'}, {'abstract': 'Instead of seizing the opportunity to distinguish himself with Geno Smith unavailable, Mark Sanchez finished 13 of 23 for 169 yards in an inconsistent performance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/18/sports/football/with-stage-to-himself-sanchez-gives-boost-to-understudy.html', 'snippet': 'Instead of seizing the opportunity to distinguish himself with Geno Smith unavailable, Mark Sanchez finished 13 of 23 for 169 yards in an inconsistent performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — Sidelined by a sprained ankle, Geno Smith spent Saturday night on the Jets’ sideline, keeping a vigilant eye on his competition. Smith watched Mark Sanchez complete his first five passes, including a touchdown, just as he would watch Sanchez thwart a potential scoring drive with an interception in the end zone, just as he would watch the Jets fail to score after having first-and-goal from the Jacksonville 3 on Sanchez’s final series before halftime.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/jets/jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/jets/jets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/jets/jets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/18/sports/jets/jets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 't