cle/90fab004-34bb-51ca-80a7-8b6531e9a79b', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/90fab004-34bb-51ca-80a7-8b6531e9a79b'}, {'abstract': 'In the Hudson Valley Shakespeare Festival production of “King Lear,” a sylvan world surrounding the Boscobel House and Gardens is transformed from enchanted daylight into deepest night.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/theater/reviews/king-lear-in-an-enchanted-setting-along-the-hudson-river.html', 'snippet': 'In the Hudson Valley Shakespeare Festival production of “King Lear,” a sylvan world surrounding the Boscobel House and Gardens is transformed from enchanted daylight into deepest night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GARRISON, N.Y. — Been thinking of taking early retirement? Before making that decision, you might want to hear about this guy I met up in Putnam County on the gorgeous grounds of a Hudson River mansion. He looked to be no more than, say, 50-something.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 687, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1374, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/LEAR/LEAR-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Upon a Sylvan Riverside Lawn, Woeful Darkness Settles', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Upon a Sylvan Riverside Lawn, Woeful Darkness Settles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hudson Valley Shakespeare Festival', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'King Lear (Play)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shakespeare, William', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Stephen Paul', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Ryan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Terrence (1953- )", 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-18T21:51:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Brantley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brantley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/7a6f4e7b-1fe3-5476-90f9-220f4e9bd429', 'word_count': 1033, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7a6f4e7b-1fe3-5476-90f9-220f4e9bd429'}, {'abstract': 'The conductor David Afkham made his debut with the Mostly Mozart Festival Orchestra in a performance of Brahms’s works at Lincoln Center.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/arts/music/david-afkham-leads-the-mostly-mozart-festival-orchestra.html', 'snippet': 'The conductor David Afkham made his debut with the Mostly Mozart Festival Orchestra in a performance of Brahms’s works at Lincoln Center.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sprezzatura is not a term usually associated with Brahms. Coined in 16th-century Urbino by Baldassare Castiglione, the author of the Renaissance blockbuster guide to courtly manners, the Italian word denotes an elegant lightness of bearing that masks the effort behind the composure. The music of Brahms? The opposite, surely, with quill-chewing, meticulous labor audible in every earnestly created bar.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/BRAHAMS/BRAHAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 471, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/BRAHAMS/BRAHAMS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 471}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/BRAHAMS/BRAHAMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/BRAHAMS/BRAHAMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1606, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/BRAHAMS/BRAHAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/BRAHAMS/BRAHAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type