Delete,” a television movie that has its debut on Reelz on Monday night. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/delete/delete-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/delete/delete-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 573, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/delete/delete-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/delete/delete-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/delete/delete-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Artificial Intelligence Is Ruining My Commute', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'This Artificial Intelligence Is Ruining My Commute', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ReelzChannel', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-18T21:55:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Genzlinger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Genzlinger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/62ba0128-8c48-53c0-a0ff-883ea4a98fe9', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62ba0128-8c48-53c0-a0ff-883ea4a98fe9'}, {'abstract': 'Francesca Harper’s dance-theater production “Art Prototype 2013” uses beauty pageants as its point of departure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/arts/dance/francesca-harpers-art-prototype-2013-mocks-beauty-shows.html', 'snippet': 'Francesca Harper’s dance-theater production “Art Prototype 2013” uses beauty pageants as its point of departure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At the start of Francesca Harper’s “Art Prototype 2013,” a dance-theater production using beauty pageants as its point of departure, a woman slowly crossed the stage while trailing two long strips of white fabric. Another performer passed the other way, marking the stage with an X. The dancer Eriko Iisaku, her body both lissome and punctuated, dashed across and underneath the pieces of the fabric before landing on her rear; gradually, her legs splayed. Then, like much of what happened throughout this congested work, the moment was abandoned; it trailed off, leading to nowhere. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Knocking the Crowns Off Pageant Winners', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Knocking The Crowns Off Pageant Winners', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harper, Francesca', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-18T21:57:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gia Kourlas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kourlas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/d98b563a-5858-52d1-8dca-7c5dc11189aa', 'word_count': 414, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d98b563a-5858-52d1-8dca-7c5dc11189aa'}, {'abstract': 'Kim M. Catullo, a corporate lawyer who initially tried to talk Christine C. Quinn out of running for New York City mayor, said she had been worried about her wife’s safety.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/nyregion/quinns-wife-is-a-reluctant-campaigner.html', 'snippet': 'Kim M. Catullo, a corporate lawyer who initially tried to talk Christine C. Quinn out of running for New York City mayor, said she had been worried about her wife’s safety.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kim M. Catullo does not like giving interviews or getting behind a microphone. At political events, she tends to hover in the background, so much so that she is sometimes mistaken for a member of her wife’s security detail.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/CATULLO_span/CATULLOspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/CATULLO_span/CATULLOspan-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/CATULLO_span/CATULLOspan-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/CATULLO_span/CATULLOspan-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/C