/leaving-his-mark-on-the-citys-courts.html', 'snippet': 'Robert Garcia’s obsession has not faded in his years of playing in and organizing games on city park courts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Life was no game for Robert Garcia in early 1987. He had just been cut from Wesleyan’s basketball squad — for the third time. Come spring break, he headed home and went straight to Goat Park at Amsterdam Avenue and 99th Street, where he had always practiced and studied hoops with fierce dedication. He was not tall or fast, but he was on fire.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 442, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 442}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 755, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1509, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/nyregion/SIDE/SIDE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType'