c8f7-5a74-8eed-49679126dc32'}, {'abstract': 'Tangible examples of the resulting spending cuts abound five months after lawmakers failed to reach an agreement on how to reduce the nation’s debt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/us/us-workers-are-grounded-by-deep-cuts.html', 'snippet': 'Tangible examples of the resulting spending cuts abound five months after lawmakers failed to reach an agreement on how to reduce the nation’s debt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Geological visits to monitor volcanoes in Alaska have been scaled back. The defense secretary is traveling to Afghanistan two times a year instead of the usual four. For the first time in nearly three decades, NASA pulled out of the National Space Symposium, in Colorado Springs, even though representatives from France, Germany and China all made the trip.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/us/jp-GROUNDED-1/jp-GROUNDED-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/19/us/jp-GROUNDED-1/jp-GROUNDED-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/us/jp-GROUNDED-1/jp-GROUNDED-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/us/jp-GROUNDED-1/jp-GROUNDED-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1285, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/us/jp-GROUNDED-1/jp-GROUNDED-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType'