ay', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nancy Folbre', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Folbre', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/491f6594-3d43-519b-a7d0-ac46330d4b57', 'word_count': 775, 'uri': 'nyt://article/491f6594-3d43-519b-a7d0-ac46330d4b57'}, {'abstract': 'Modern kitchen appliances and gadgets offer many opportunities for injury.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/tested-recipes-for-kitchen-safety/', 'snippet': 'Modern kitchen appliances and gadgets offer many opportunities for injury.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Today’s kitchens easily supplant the bathroom as the home’s most dangerous room. While scalds and falls on tile can inflict serious harm in the bathroom, modern kitchen appliances and gadgets offer many more opportunities for injury. Even a seemingly simple kitchen task can result in a devastating injury.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/science/20brody/20brody-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 392, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/17/science/20brody/20brody-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 392}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/science/20brody/20brody-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 669, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/17/science/20brody/20brody-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 1979, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'ima