igation” over the Dell buyout, but a judge’s statements on Friday are a vindication for the Dell board and the procedures it put in place.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carl C. Icahn once threatened “years of litigation” over the Dell buyout. Unfortunately for him, a Delaware court appeared to disagree at a hearing on Friday, leaving the investor to make a last stand at Dell’s Sept. 12 shareholder meeting. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Judge’s Ruling Ends Legal Threat to Dell Buyout', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mergers, Acquisitions and Divestitures', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dell, Michael S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Icahn, Carl C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Strine, Leo E Jr', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Dell Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Silver Lake Partners', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Delaware', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-19T15:32:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b36cec6-4c00-5288-b3b0-a84eb9863e7a', 'word_count': 1215, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b36cec6-4c00-5288-b3b0-a84eb9863e7a'}, {'abstract': 'The 428i coupe is a handsome car, but was largely ignored next to the flamboyant styling of the gold M4 concept.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/pebble-beach-weekend-bmw-unveils-428i-coupe-and-m4-concept/', 'snippet': 'The 428i coupe is a handsome car, but was largely ignored next to the flamboyant styling of the gold M4 concept.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PEBBLE BEACH, Calif. — BMW’s expected reveal of the production 2014 428i coupe was supplemented Friday by the unveiling of the flared and creased M4 concept coupe. Presented in an arresting, one-off gold-dust color, the M4 concept showed just how daring its designer, Florian Nissl, can be.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pebble Beach Weekend: BMW Unveils 428i Coupe and M4 Concept', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pebble Beach (Calif)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-19T15:34:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ronald Ahrens', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ronald', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahrens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b3135a6-9c8e-5db5-8377-51b7ec9b5265', 'word_count': 268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b3135a6-9c8e-5db5-8377-51b7ec9b5265'}, {'abstract': 'James McBride’s new novel is a romp about John Brown’s crusade against slavery.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/book-review-podcast-james-mcbrides-good-lord-bird/', 'snippet': 'James McBride’s new novel is a romp about John Brown’s crusade against slavery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In The New York Times Book Review, Baz Dreisinger reviews James McBride’s 