793c30ecc9'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Murray, whose prose style was influenced by jazz and the blues, wrote about black culture as inextricable from American culture.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/20/books/albert-murray-essayist-who-challenged-the-conventional-dies-at-97.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Murray, whose prose style was influenced by jazz and the blues, wrote about black culture as inextricable from American culture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Albert Murray, an essayist, critic and novelist who influenced the national discussion about race by challenging black separatism, insisting that the black experience was essential to American culture and inextricably tied to it, died on Sunday at his home in Harlem. He was 97.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1354, 'width': 1938, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/Murrayobit1/Murrayobit1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Albert Murray, Scholar Who Saw a Multicolored American Culture, Dies at 97', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Scholar Saw a Multicolored American Culture', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murray, Albert (1916-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Watkins, Mel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-19T16:48:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mel Watkins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Watkins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/bd3575fd-187a-5899-8a24-2082a6e16271', 'word_count': 2199, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bd3575fd-187a-5899-8a24-2082a6e16271'}, {'abstract': 'Lost children, separated from their families because of conflicts in Uganda or Sudan, can now be reunited with their families much faster — hours, instead of weeks — thanks to a new app that replaces a paper-based process using carbon-copy forms.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/children-lost-in-war-zones-and-disasters-find-their-families-with-an-app/', 'snippet': 'Lost children, separated from their families because of conflicts in Uganda or Sudan, can now be reunited with their families much faster — hours, instead of weeks — thanks to a new app that replaces a paper-based process using carbon-copy forms.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Entrepreneurs often talk about the “pain points” their new app or service will ease, but as it has been repeatedly pointed out, the problems they solve are more often than not the problems of affluent and hyper-connected 20-somethings in cities with great cell service and ample Wi-Fi.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/technology/bits-uganda/bits-uganda-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/16/technology/bits-uganda/bits-uganda-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/technology/bits-uganda/bits-uganda-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 689, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/technology/bits-uganda/bits-uganda-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 944, 'width': 1404, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/16/technology/bits-uganda/bits-uganda-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'t