on-joined-briefly-in-song/', 'snippet': 'A track with Justin Bieber adding vocals to a song recorded by Michael Jackson appeared online over the weekend, but was later removed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Justin Bieber and Michael Jackson were united in song over the weekend when a recording of Mr. Bieber singing along with vocals previously recorded by Mr. Jackson surfaced online, provoking a hailstorm of news reports and stoking a great deal of fan interest on social media. The track, “Slave 2 the Rhythm,” also was played on British radio, The Guardian reported.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/19artsbeat-bieber/19artsbeat-bieber-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 209, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/19artsbeat-bieber/19artsbeat-bieber-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 209}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/19artsbeat-bieber/19artsbeat-bieber-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 356, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/19artsbeat-bieber/19artsbeat-bieber-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 712, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/19artsbeat-bieber/19artsbeat-bieber-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/19/arts/19artsbeat-bieber/19artsbeat-bieber-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type