', 'word_count': 371, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16dcc78d-6f1f-58aa-aa1e-8a64428592f1'}, {'abstract': 'The Federal Reserve said Monday that some banks did not pay enough attention to the risks that were particular to their assets and operations.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/banks-were-not-tough-enough-on-themselves-in-stress-tests-fed-says/', 'snippet': 'The Federal Reserve said Monday that some banks did not pay enough attention to the risks that were particular to their assets and operations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Most large banks appear to have been sailing through the annual “health checkups” they have had to undergo since the financial crisis.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Banks Are Falling Short in Planning for the Worst, Fed Says', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Banks Coming Up Short in Planning for the Worst, Fed Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ally Financial Inc.', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bank of America Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BB&T Corporation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-19T17:49:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Eavis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eavis', 'qualifier': None, 'ti