': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/19/tyne-daly-to-star-in-new-terrence-mcnally-play-on-broadway/', 'snippet': 'Ms. Daly will play a mother who visits her dead son’s former lover in Mr. McNally’s new play “Mothers and Sons.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Tony and Emmy Award-winning actress Tyne Daly (“Gypsy”) will return to Broadway in the spring of 2014 to star in “Mothers and Sons,” a new play by the Tony Award-winning playwright Terrence McNally (“Love! Valour! Compassion!”). Sheryl Kaller, who in June directed the show’s premiere at the Bucks County Playhouse in New Hope, Pa., will reprise her duties for Broadway. Additional casting, run dates and a theater are to be announced.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/theater/19daly/19daly-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 523, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/theater/19daly/19daly-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 523, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/theater/19daly/19daly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/19/theater/19daly/19daly-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/19/theater/19daly/19daly-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tyne Daly to Star in New Terrence McNally Play on Broadway', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': No