ravis d’Arnaud learned the Mets plan to keep him on the major league roster for the rest of the season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/20/sports/baseball/mets-complete-long-overdue-sweep-of-twins-with-pit-stop-in-minnesota.html', 'snippet': 'Dillon Gee topped the Twins in a makeup game from April 14, and Travis d’Arnaud learned the Mets plan to keep him on the major league roster for the rest of the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MINNEAPOLIS — Shortly after learning the Mets planned to keep him for the rest of the season, the rookie catcher Travis d’Arnaud returned to his locker and found the veteran reliever LaTroy Hawkins standing in front of it talking to a reporter. Protocol and humility are vital for someone with only three days in the major leagues, so d’Arnaud, 24, asked Hawkins if he could slip by, careful not to offend his 40-year-old teammate.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/baseball/20mets-1/20mets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/baseball/20mets-1/20mets-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/baseball/20mets-1/20mets-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/baseball/20mets-1/20mets-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/baseball/20mets-1/20mets-1-thum