ort-zone.html', 'snippet': 'Geno Smith knows that a good showing in Saturday’s game against the Giants is a critical factor in the Jets’ decision to choose him or Mark Sanchez as their starting quarterback.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — As much as Jets Coach Rex Ryan insists the quarterback competition is not over, the demeanor and words of the incumbent Mark Sanchez and the rookie Geno Smith on Monday appeared to hint at the more likely outcome.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1342, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/sports/Y-JETS/Y-JETS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Smith Feels Pressure as Sanchez Finds Comfort', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Smith Feels Pressure as Sanchez Finds Comfort', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pedulla, Tom', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Geno', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Mark', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-20T00:32:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Pedulla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pedulla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f69fb33-8f17-53f2-8522-5afb9a13b657', 'word_count': 671, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f69fb33-8f17-53f2-8522-5afb9a13b657'}, {'abstract': 'Administration officials and some lawmakers have expressed frustration that critical parts of President Obama’s financial overhaul, the Dodd-Frank act, remain unenforced.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/20/business/obama-presses-for-action-on-bank-rules.html', 'snippet': 'Administration officials and some lawmakers have expressed frustration that critical parts of President Obama’s financial overhaul, the Dodd-Frank act, remain unenforced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Obama urged the nation’s top financial regulators on Monday to move faster on new rules for Wall Street, telling them in a private White House meeting that they must work to prevent a repeat of the 2008 financial crisis.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New Y