fafbe3a67fce', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a5659bea-0c27-5907-bd31-fafbe3a67fce'}, {'abstract': 'Lessons in economic incentives from a show on Netflix — and from Netflix itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/magazine/what-a-tv-show-can-teach-us-about-capitalism.html', 'snippet': 'Lessons in economic incentives from a show on Netflix — and from Netflix itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After furiously binge-streaming all 13 episodes of “Orange Is the New Black,” the Netflix comic drama about a former Connecticut debutante serving a 15-month jail sentence for laundering drug money, I devoured, equally eagerly, the book from which it was adapted. Then I took my obsession to what some might consider the extreme: I attended the American Correction Association’s 143rd Congress of Correction outside Washington.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/magazine/25economy/mag-25Economy-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/magazine/25economy/mag-25Economy-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 733}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/magazine/25economy/mag-25Economy-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 839, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/magazine/25economy/mag-25Economy-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1663, 'width': 1361, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/magazine/25economy/mag-25Economy-t_CA0-thumbStandard.