0/photo-editors-who-made-a-difference/', 'snippet': 'Photographers recall the luminary editors who are or were integral, if unseen, forces in getting their images to the fore.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photo editors play a bigger role in photographers’ lives than just choosing their best pictures. Often, it’s an editor’s voice that photographers hear in the back of their mind, urging them to strive harder for the defining image. They become lifelong friends, confidants and mentors. They can become surrogate parents or siblings — and, as with most family members, there’s a good chance they’ll drive you nuts.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photo Editors Who Made a Difference', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mentors', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Mike', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'duCille, Michel', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mastricolo, Carlo', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Morris, John G', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pledge, Robert', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-20T09:00:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By Yunghi Kim and Kenneth Jarecke', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Yunghi', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Kenneth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jarecke', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e703bec-fcda-5dec-bd60-1a2be71f024a', 'word_count': 1852, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e70