, 'word_count': 661, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a836c9b6-ae12-509c-a81e-241fa988e2e9'}, {'abstract': 'The cause of the blast, which occurred in a marine boat repair shop at a weapons station, was still under investigation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/nyregion/8-injured-in-explosion-at-navy-station-in-new-jersey.html', 'snippet': 'The cause of the blast, which occurred in a marine boat repair shop at a weapons station, was still under investigation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An explosion at a Navy base in New Jersey on Tuesday left at least eight people hurt, one of them seriously, the authorities said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '8 Injured in Explosion at Navy Station in New Jersey', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Blast Injures 8 at a Base in New Jersey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Explosions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Navy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Monmouth County (NJ)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-20T15:58:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Marc Santora', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Marc', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Santora', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc822bb6-8d61-5fdc-83b2-9d54a7fabf73', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc822bb6-8d61-5fdc-83b2-9d54a7fabf73'}, {'abstract': 'The Latvian-born violinist is holding a concert in Berlin as “a kind of a personal statement against injustice” in Russia.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/20/q-and-a-gidon-kremer-on-freedom-and-human-rights-in-russia/', 'snippet': 'The Latvian-born violinist is holding a concert in Berlin as “a kind of a personal statement against injustice” in Russia.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Russia’s freedoms and human rights record will be the focus of a concert that Gidon Kremer, the Latvian-born violinist and the founder of the Kremerata Baltica chamber orchestra, plans to hold in Berlin on Oct. 7 — the anniversary of the killing of Anna Politkovskaya, a Russian journalist and critic of the Kremlin who was slain in 2006. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/20artsbeat-kremer/20artsbeat-kremer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 782, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/20artsbeat-kremer/20artsbeat-kremer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 782}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/20artsbeat-kremer/20artsbeat-kremer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 786, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/20artsbeat-kremer/20artsbeat-kremer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 1005, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/20artsbeat-kremer/20artsbeat-kremer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/20/arts/20artsbeat-kremer/20artsbeat-kremer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, '