struggling Brooklyn hospital after assuming management in 2011.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a surprise ruling cheered by nurses, doctors and others who have fought to keep a Brooklyn hospital open, but which may have muddled its fate even further, a judge on Tuesday ordered the hospital to be returned to its previous owners, nullifying a 2011 transfer to the State University of New York.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Judge Rejects Long Island College Hospital’s Ownership Deal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Judge Rejects Ownership Deal for Hospital', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Continuum Health Partners', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State University of New York', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Long Island College Hospital', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Cobble Hill (Brooklyn, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-20T22:11:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anemona Hartocollis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anemona', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hartocollis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53ace225-f3ee-5f2c-bf24-3fded2ffd956', 'word_count': 686, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53ace225-f3ee-5f2c-bf24-3fded2ffd956'}, {'abstract': 'After years of reduced spending, hotel owners in the city are making capital improvements, spurred in part by fears of bad reviews on online sites.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/realestate/commercial/new-york-hotels-decide-its-time-for-a-makeover.html', 'snippet': 'After years of reduced spending, hotel owners in the city are making capital improvements, spurred in part by fears of bad reviews on online sites.', 'lead_paragraph': 'New York hotels are at the forefront of a boom in complete makeovers, after years of lower capital spending caused by the steep economic downturn.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 368, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 368}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 629, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1258, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/business/Hotel1/Hotel1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Hotels Decide It’s Time for a Makeover',