off most were hard at work.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SARATOGA SPRINGS, N.Y. — For many horseplayers, the dark day at Saratoga is a time to hit the reset button. It is a chance to turn off the OTB Channel, swear off speed and pace figures and do something nice for yourself. Like your laundry. Or retire to the Roosevelt Spa to soak in the healing mineral waters as Diamond Jim Brady, J. P. Morgan, Lillian Russell and a roll call of celebrities from a century past once did.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 280, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 280}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 478, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 957, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/sports/RACING/RACING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}],