ely with Republican-appointed judges, has named Judge José A. Cabranes, a Democratic appointee, to the panel that hears rare appeals of the surveillance court’s rulings.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/COURT/COURT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 468, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/COURT/COURT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 468, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/COURT/COURT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/21/us/COURT/COURT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/COURT/COURT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Newest Spy Court Pick Is a Democrat but Not a Liberal', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Roberts Varies Pattern In Choice for Spy Court', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Foreign Intelligence Surveillance Court', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Savage, Charlie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cabranes, Jose A', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roberts, John G Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-