raphers/', 'snippet': 'Photographers recall photo editors’ influence on their careers in Part 2 of a two-part series on that symbiotic relationship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not only do photojournalists get to travel the world, wear funky scarves and meet all kinds of people, they usually get their name underneath their images when they are published in magazines and newspapers or online. Photo editors, on the other hand, are usually stuck in an office, toiling anonymously. No matter how good a job they do, their name won’t appear in the newspaper the next day. (Unless they commit a crime.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Editing Pictures, Influencing Photographers', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrato, Donna', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Grossfeld, Stan', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lee, Nancy', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Loengard, John', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stevens, Robert', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T09:00:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/283a45bb-f180-53e9-a55d-ebcf47b077b9', 'word_count': 1582, 'uri': 'nyt://article/283a45bb-f180-53e9-a55d-ebcf47b077b9'}, {'abstract': 'Vestas, once a star of the wind power industry, named Anders Runevad as its new chief executive after losses and declining revenue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/business/global/danish-wind-turbine-maker-appoints-new-leader.html', 'snippet': 'Vestas, once a star of the wind power industry, named Anders Runevad as its new chief executive after losses and declining revenue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Vestas, the Danish wind turbine maker that once led the industry but that has struggled in recent years, ousted its chief executive on Wednesday and appointed a successor, while also reporting another quarter of lackluster results.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 777, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 777}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 792, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 1050, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/business/Vestas2/Vestas2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Chief at Vestas, Ailing Maker of Wind Turbines', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Chief Executive at Ailing Wind Turbine Company', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reed, Stanley', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Vestas Wind Systems AS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wind Power', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Appointments and Executive Changes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Company Reports', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Runevad, Anders', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Engel, Ditlev', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T09:49:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stanley Reed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stanley', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb7c9daf-2281-5642-b033-3cc8ce17c79d', 'word_count': 867, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb7c9daf-2281-5642-b033-3cc8ce17c79d'}, {'abstract': 'Of 101 films released by the six major studios in 2012, Glaad said only 14 of them contained characters that were identified as lesbian, gay or bisexual, and none that were were transgender.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/glaad-study-of-2012-movies-finds-few-gay-characters-on-screen/', 'snippet': 'Of 101 films released by the six major studios in 2012, Glaad said only 14 of them contained characters that were identified as lesbian, gay or bisexual, and none that were were transgender.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In its first substantial study of releases from the major film studios, the media watchdog group Glaad faulted Hollywood for its lack of lesbian, gay, bisexual and transgender (L.G.B.T.) characters last year. This study, issued by Glaad on Wednesday and titled “2013 Studio Responsibility Index,” found that of 101 films from the six major studios in 2012, 14 included characters who were identified as lesbian, gay or bisexual, and none who were transgender. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Study of 2012 Movies Finds Few Gay Characters on Big Screen', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Transgender and Transsexual', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bardem, Javier', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Gay and Lesbian Alliance Against Defamation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Paramount Pictures', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sony Corporation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twentieth Century Fox', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walt Disney Company', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Warner Brothers', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T10:00:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/59c9502b-6271-5f31-92df-c41c09becf77', 'word_count': 346, 'uri': 'nyt://article/59c9502b-6271-5f31-92df-c41c09becf77'}, {'abstract': 'The Chevrolet Corvair is one of the most unique American cars ever built, so what’s it like to own one?', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/the-twists-and-turns-of-owning-a-1965-chevrolet-corvair/', 'snippet': 'The Chevrolet Corvair is one of the most unique American cars ever built, so what’s it like to own one?', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Corvair broke down the day after I bought it. It was hard enough to kick my daily driver out of the garage, but now the yellow Monza coupe, which I had just driven 180 miles from the outskirts of Chicago to Indianapolis without incident, refused to accelerate. Buyer’s remorse began to set in.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 577, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1153, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/20/automobiles/wheels/corvair-1/corvair-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Twists and Turns of Owning a 1965 Chevrolet Corvair', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Cars (Compact, Subcompact and Microcars)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nader, Ralph', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chevrolet Division of General Motors Corp', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indianapolis (Ind)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T10:00:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tudor Van Hampton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tudor', 'middlename': 'Van', 'lastname': 'Hampton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2fe5671-e510-5d3e-863e-ffc754914793', 'word_count': 688, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2fe5671-e510-5d3e-863e-ffc754914793'}, {'abstract': 'What you need to know for Wednesday: The mayoral candidates debate, a community party on the High Line and remembering a historic march and speech 50 years later.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/new-york-today-another-chance-to-debate/', 'snippet': 'What you need to know for Wednesday: The mayoral candidates debate, a community party on the High Line and remembering a historic march and speech 50 years later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated, 8:40 a.m. | The first televised general topic debate for the Democratic nomination that features all seven main mayoral candidates can be seen tonig