ness-for-sale-would-you-pay-2-5-million/', 'snippet': 'What questions would you want the current owner to answer?', 'lead_paragraph': 'In my posts, I occasionally take a look at businesses for sale, which can offer interesting lessons in both how to market a business and how to buy one. For this post, we’ll look at a distributor of electrical components. This company has been in business for more than 20 years and is on track to do almost $12 million in sales this year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Business for Sale: Would You Pay $2.5 Million?', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T11:00:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Patrick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patrick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f6d86c7-c27b-5f2a-9a50-961c3a50b415', 'word_count': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f6d86c7-c27b-5f2a-9a50-961c3a50b415'}, {'abstract': 'The currency dropped by more than 2 percent against the dollar, hitting another record low amid more uncertainty about what American Federal Reserve minutes will signal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/business/global/rupee-suffers-another-record-low.html', 'snippet': 'The currency dropped by more than 2 percent against the dollar, hitting another record low amid more uncertainty about what American Federal Reserve minutes will signal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — The beleaguered Indian rupee continued its steep descent on Wednesday, hitting a record low of 64.54 to the dollar amid global nervousne