ubuque', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b72820e3-d2af-59f6-aa2a-b09c007b3d60', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b72820e3-d2af-59f6-aa2a-b09c007b3d60'}, {'abstract': 'A significant increase in onion prices in India has ignited political wars and led to a highway robbery.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/rising-onion-prices-tempt-highway-robbers-in-india/', 'snippet': 'A significant increase in onion prices in India has ignited political wars and led to a highway robbery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI— On Saturday night, Mintu Chottelal, 30, a truck driver, and his helper, Rinku Gujjar, 19, were driving along the Delhi-Jaipur Highway on their way from the town of Nagore in Rajasthan to the town of Meerut in Uttar Pradesh. Suddenly, a minivan came to a halt in front of them. Three men jumped off the vehicle, overpowered Mr. Chottelal and Mr. Gujjar, and drove away with their loot.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-onion-wholesale-IndiaInk/21-onion-wholesale-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-onion-wholesale-IndiaInk/21-onion-wholesale-IndiaInk-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-onion-wholesale-IndiaInk/21-onion-wholesale-IndiaInk-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 693, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-onion-wholes