, public disgust over the depth of corruption in India boiled over into huge protests led by the longtime social activist Anna Hazare. His nearly two-week hunger strike brought out hundreds of thousands of people and forced lawmakers to support his legislative proposal to create an independent anticorruption agency, known as Lokpal.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/world/asia/21-hazare/21-hazare-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hazare Embarks on His Next Movement', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hazare, Anna', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Indian National Congress', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T21:30:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shreeya Sinha', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shreeya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sinha', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/130bffcd-3605-50e9-a646-f1a5c7834c52', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/130bffcd-3605-50e9-a646-f1a5c7834c52'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Leonard’s work was defined as much by what he didn’t write as by what he did.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/books/elmore-leonard-a-man-of-few-yet-perfect-words.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Leonard’s work was defined as much by what he didn’t write as by what he did.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When “Freaky Deaky” came out in 1988, Elmore Leonard’s writing credo hadn’t quite kicked in yet. Though he would later deliver 10 great rules for writing with streamlined tough-guy elegance, the dedication for “Freaky Deaky” thanked his wife for giving him “a certain look when I write too many words.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22ELMORE/22ELMORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 914, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22ELMORE/22ELMORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 914