man who finds his body taken over by his late mother.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/21/new-york-fringe-festival-report-brenda/', 'snippet': 'Cory Finley’s play is about a guilt-ridden young man who finds his body taken over by his late mother.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Reviews of shows from the New York International Fringe Festival will appear on ArtsBeat through the festival’s close on Aug. 25. For more information, go to fringenyc.org.Given that she’s the title character of Cory Finley’s comedy, Brenda Garrison takes a long time to arrive. (Too long.) Rather, it’s her feckless son Wallace (Sam Bolen) who guides us into a cockeyed world that includes his lunkheaded jock roommate, Mike (Bill Coyne), and Jen (Emily Kron), a high-strung co-worker at the Best Cosmetics counter.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New York Fringe Festival Report: ‘Brenda’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Brenda', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'New York International Fringe Festival', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-21T22:06:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Heller', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Heller', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6ec2937-411e-582d-9899-f55e1cad47fe', 'word_count': 257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6ec2937-411e-582d-9899-f55e1cad47fe'}, {'abstract': 'A new collection of tableware honors the relationship between Portugal and Brazil.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/garden/a-500-year-bond-reflected-in-porcelain.html', 'snippet': 'A new collection of tableware honors the relationship between Portugal and Brazil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are many ways to mark a 500-year-old cultural exchange between Portugal and Brazil. Transatlântica tableware from the Portuguese company Vista Alegre does it with cobalt, gold and tiny sea horses and firearms.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/garden/22GOODS_SPAN/22CURR2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A 500-Year Bond Reflected in Porcelain', 'kicker': 'Currents | Goods', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '500 Years Of a Bond Reflected In Porcelain', 'name':