but Ford is gave New Yorkers a chance to put the sporty little hatch through its paces last week on a course set up at Citi Field.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/a-hot-spin-in-a-ford-fiesta-st/', 'snippet': 'The Fiesta ST isn’t available in dealerships yet, but Ford is gave New Yorkers a chance to put the sporty little hatch through its paces last week on a course set up at Citi Field.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I had a chance to drive the 2014 Ford Fiesta a few weeks back, I found it to be, more or less, a delightful econobox. Thrifty, spry and unhindered by the polite manners that can make much larger cars a chore to drive, it was missing only one thing: power.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/automobiles/wheels/Ford-Fiesta-ST/Ford-Fiesta-ST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/21/automobiles/wheels/Ford-Fiesta-ST/Ford-Fiesta-ST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/automobiles/wheels/Ford-Fiesta-ST/Ford-Fiesta-ST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 575, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/automobiles/wheels/Ford-Fiesta-ST/Ford-Fiesta-ST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 674, 'width': 1200, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/automobiles/wheels/Ford-Fiesta-ST/Ford-Fiesta-ST-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/21/automo