'nyt://article/eb986228-4498-5b6c-b25b-ea877143011f'}, {'abstract': 'Li Wangzhi, the elder son of the purged Chinese official Bo Xilai, released a statement after the opening day of his father’s corruption trial.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/world/asia/statement-by-bo-xilais-son-after-opening-of-trial.html', 'snippet': 'Li Wangzhi, the elder son of the purged Chinese official Bo Xilai, released a statement after the opening day of his father’s corruption trial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Thursday, Li Wangzhi, the elder son of the purged Chinese official Bo Xilai, attended the opening session of Mr. Bo’s trial on charges of corruption, bribe-taking and abuse of power. It was the first time Mr. Li, a son to Mr. Bo from his first marriage, had seen his father in several years. Mr. Li released the following statement after the proceedings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Statement by Bo Xilai’s Son After Opening  of Trial', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bo Xilai', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Courts and the Judiciary', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-22T18:44:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'Text', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4cdd442-c0a3-52dc-b341-047954ad684b', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4cdd442-c0a3-52dc-b341-047954ad684b'}, {'abstract': 'William T. Vollmann made the discovery when reading from his F.B.I. file.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/fbi-listed-prize-winning-author-as-a-unabomber-suspect/', 'snippet': 'William T. Vollmann made the discovery when reading from his F.B.I. file.', 'lead_paragraph': 'William T. Vollmann probably expected to find something worth writing about in his F.B.I. file. But he did not expect to discover that he’d been listed as a suspect in the case of the Unabomber. The National Book Award winning author, known for his many works of fiction and reportage, wrote about the F.B.I.’s surveillance of him in this month’s issue of Harper’s Magazine.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22artsbeat-vollman/22artsbeat-vollman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 430, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22artsbeat-vollman/22artsbeat-vollman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 601, 'width': 430, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22artsbeat-vollman/22artsbeat-vollman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22artsbeat-vollman/22artsbeat-vollman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/22/arts/22artsbeat-vollman/22artsbeat-vollman-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'F.B.I. Listed Prize-Winning Author as a Unabomber Suspect', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'F.B.I. Listed Author  As Unabomber Suspect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-22T18:44:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel McDermon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'McDermon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58d0e3da-dca5-5ba2-89e5-66a0168b7768', 'word_count': 234, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58d0e3da-dca5-5ba2-89e5-66a0168b7768'}, {'abstract': 'On a trip around this Croatian peninsula, the author renews his romance with a regional wine and discovers another  culinary product to savor: local olive oil.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/travel/sipping-the-pleasures-of-istria.html', 'snippet': 'On a trip around this Croatian peninsula, the author renews his romance with a regional wine and discovers another  culinary product to savor: local olive oil.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On a recent afternoon, I found myself having lunch on a shaded patio about 20 feet from the banks of a placid river that empties out into the Adriatic Sea. The restaurant, Martin Pescador — named for the bird that skims the water’s surface in search of food — is in Trget, a fishing village in the region of northern Croatia known as Istria. I’d arrived there after a rough drive down a 10-mile road that hugs the Rasa River and then traverses railroad tracks and freight depots and lumberyards before dead-ending in Trget. Docked nearby were about 20 boats, the same number as residents of the village.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25JPISTIRA5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25JPISTIRA5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25JPISTIRA5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25JPISTIRA5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25ISTIRA5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25ISTIRA5-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/travel/25ISTIRA5/25ISTIRA5-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sipping the Pleasures of Istria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Mysteries of Istria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draper, Robert', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olive Oil', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Istria (Croatia)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-22T19:03:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article'