ed two Islamist sit-ins in Cairo.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/22/egyptian-police-failed-to-defend-churches-rights-group-says/', 'snippet': 'A Human Rights Watch video report documents “simultaneous” attacks on churches across Egypt on the same day security forces violently dispersed two Islamist sit-ins in Cairo.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As my colleague Kareem Fahim reported from Nazla, Egypt, dozens of churches and other facilities connected to Egypt’s Christian minority have been attacked and burned in the last seven days by Islamists seeking revenge for the ouster of President Mohamed Morsi and a violent government crackdown that has left hundreds of his supporters dead.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Egyptian Police Failed to Defend Churches, Rights Group Says', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Human Rights Watch', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-22T21:14:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62f51b33-849a-5e92-9739-19ee3b076a07', 'word_count': 821, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62f51b33-849a-5e92-9739-19ee3b076a07'}, {'abstract': 'A sister of Mediterraneo in Greenwich and the latest addition to the Z Hospitality Group has a short menu but makes a big impression.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/nyregion/a-review-of-mediterraneo-in-norwalk.html', 'snippet': 'A sister of Mediterraneo in Greenwich and the latest addition to the Z Hospitality Group has a short menu but makes a big impression.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The owners of Mediterraneo, which opened in April at the new Hotel Zero Degrees in Norwalk, want diners to imagine that they have stepped into the dining salon of a large, majestic yacht. That explains the beautiful teak-and-holly floor that resembles a deck and the three enormous columns that punctuate the room.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25SUBDINECT2/25SUBDINECT2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 613, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25SUBDINECT2/25SUBDINECT2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 613}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25SUBDINECT2/25SUBDINECT2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1003, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25SUBDINECT2/25SUBDINECT2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2005, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25SUBDINECT2/25SUBDINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25SUBDINECT2/25SUBDINECT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 