heir own wine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Olive Lucy’s Kitchen Table is a pleasant place at which to pass a sultry summer evening. It has comfortable white-backed, tufted booths, pitchers of fresh fruit sangria and music that ranges from lively salsa to mellower Sinatra. Look around the room: people have fun here. A table piled with gift bags suggests a birthday or an engagement; Alan Valenti, the owner, in a phone conversation after my visits, said the restaurant, which opened last Valentine’s Day, was also a popular place for bachelorette parties. ', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25DINENJ2/25DINENJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25DINENJ2/25DINENJ2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 522}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25DINENJ2/25DINENJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25DINENJ2/25DINENJ2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1727, 'width': 1986, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25DINENJ2/25DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/nyregion/25DINENJ2/25DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/nyre