aradise-faith-the-second-in-ulrich-seidls-trilogy.html', 'snippet': '“Paradise: Faith,” the second film in a trilogy by the Austrian director Ulrich Seidl, examines the bleak relationship between a Roman Catholic missionary and her paraplegic Muslim husband.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Grotesquerie is in the eye of the beholder. That’s one lesson to be taken from the cinematic provocations of the Austrian filmmaker Ulrich Seidl, who, by presenting his characters as exotic specimens under a microscope, dares you to recoil. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'That Fractious Couple, Sex and Religion', 'kicker': 'Movie Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'That Fractious Couple, Sex and Religion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Seidl, Ulrich', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-22T21:51:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephen Holden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Holden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a665218-5ddd-5dd4-a6a6-d5c96bd923e1', 'word_count': 687, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a665218-5ddd-5dd4-a6a6-d5c96bd923e1'}, {'abstract': 'The Indian dancers Sonali Mishra and Shambhavi Dandekar showcase the Odissi and Kathak forms as part of Drive East at La MaMa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/arts/dance/indian-dance-forms-of-odissi-and-kathak-are-showcased.html', 'snippet': 'The Indian dancers Sonali Mishra and Shambhavi Dandekar showcase the Odissi and Kathak forms as part of Drive East at La MaMa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Drive East, a festival focusing on South Asian music and dance, continued on Wednesday with separate presentations exploring two dance forms: first, Odissi with Sonali Mishra, and later, Kathak featuring Shambhavi Dandekar. Even though La MaMa’s first-floor theater has the look of a grim church basement, there is a bright side to seeing classical Indian dance here. Details are given jewel-box prominence: the gaze, the subtle shift of a neck, the way fingers stretch and curve are as arresting as a stomp on the floor.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/arts/23DRIVE01_SPAN/0823DRIVE01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': '