3/sports/football/jets-still-not-sure-whos-under-center.html', 'snippet': 'The notion that the competition between Mark Sanchez and Geno Smith is, as the quarterbacks coach says, “too close to call” must be somewhat discouraging to the Jets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — It is the eve of the Jets’ third preseason game, and according to the quarterbacks coach David Lee, they are not “near ready” to announce a starter. That sentence is presented without comment or judgment, merely a declaration of fact, but it is fair to consider Lee’s choice of words.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETSsilo/JETSsilo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 494, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETSsilo/JETSsilo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 494}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETSsilo/JETSsilo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 843, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETSsilo/JETSsilo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1520, 'width': 1846, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETSsilo/JETSsilo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETSsilo/JETSsilo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/sports/JETS