 left knee May 22, the first day of organized team activities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. — After being removed from the physically unable to perform list Thursday, Henry Hynoski has a little more than two weeks to prepare for the Giants’ season opener at Dallas on Sept. 8. Given the nature of the fullback position, he is hopeful he can be ready.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hynoski in Race Against Clock to Make Giants’ Opener', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hynoski in Race Against Clock to Make Giants’ Opener', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Giants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hynoski, Henry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T02:29:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tom Pedulla', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tom', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pedulla', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/264d641a-10ff-5dad-9895-534d6d005cc9', 'word_count': 780, 'uri': 'nyt://article/264d641a-10ff-5dad-9895-534d6d005cc9'}, {'abstract': 'One night after his superb performance in the nightcap of the Yankees’ doubleheader sweep of the Blue Jays on Tuesday, the utility man Jayson Nix was hit by a pitch that broke his hand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/sports/baseball/a-cruel-twist-and-the-end-of-nixs-year.html', 'snippet': 'One night after his superb performance in the nightcap of the Yankees’ doubleheader sweep of the Blue Jays on Tuesday, the utility man Jayson Nix was hit by a pitch that broke his hand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It did not take long after the excitement of Tuesday night’s game for Jayson Nix to fall asleep. Despite his superb performance in the nightcap of a doubleheader sweep against the Toronto Blue Jays, Nix did not stay up all night celebrating. He received many congratulatory texts from friends and family members, including his brother, Laynce, who was released a week earlier by the Philadelphia Phillies.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Cruel Twist and the End of Nix’s Year', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Cruel Twist And the End Of Nix&#8217;s Year', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sports Injuries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nix, Jayson', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T02:32:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4427175-49bc-5d68-94f0-e53b5064685f', 'word_count': 502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4427175-49bc-5d68-94f0-e53b5064685f'}, {'abstract': 'Among the usual sharp exchanges in the third and final debate between the two Democratic candidates for city comptroller were moments of levity and a little singing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/nyregion/comptroller-debate-is-nearly-friendly.html', 'snippet': 'Among the usual sharp exchanges in the third and final debate between the two Democratic candidates for city comptroller were moments of levity and a little singing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The two Democratic can