', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/24/world/middleeast/israel-claims-successful-hit-in-southern-lebanon.html', 'snippet': 'The military said it bombed “a terrorist site” early Friday, a response to four rockets that were fired into Israel the previous day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Israel responded overnight to a rocket attack on Thursday from southern Lebanon, bombing what military officials described as a “terrorist site” between Beirut and Sidon.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israel Claims ‘Successful Hit’ in Southern Lebanon', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israel: Airstrike Hits Target in Lebanon', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lebanon', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Terrorism', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Abdullah Azzam Brigades', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missiles and Missile Defense Systems', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T07:53:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/344b3b7f-4b86-53a6-b58b-8d77fb9485f3', 'word_count': 497, 'uri': 'nyt://article/344b3b7f-4b86-53a6-b58b-8d77fb9485f3'}, {'abstract': 'Mumbai police arrested one man and identified four others for Thursday evening’s gang rape of a photojournalist in Lower Parel in Mumbai.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/photojournalist-raped-in-mumbai/', 'snippet': 'Mumbai police arrested one man and identified four others for Thursday evening’s gang rape of a photojournalist in Lower Parel in Mumbai.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MUMBAI— A female photojournalist on assignment in Mumbai was gang raped while her male colleague was tied up and beaten, the police said. Five men were being sought as suspects in the assault Thursday evening.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1344, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/24/world/India/India-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'su