ga, Mykaela and Jane.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/favorite-comments-in-our-tech-tools-student-challenge/', 'snippet': 'Months ago, we ran a student challenge asking, “What tech tools play the biggest role in your life?” We apologize for the long delay in announcing the winners, but congratulations to Oceanna, Molly, Zineb, Jason, Vivian, Oyenuga, Mykaela and Jane.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I find that now I have most of my essential conversations digitally.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Favorite Comments in Our Tech Tools Student Challenge', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T09:24:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Gonchar and Katherine Schulten', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gonchar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schulten', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4013d4d9-d570-5291-ba39-74fe029266ba', 'word_count': 2660, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4013d4d9-d570-5291-ba39-74fe029266ba'}, {'abstract': 'What you need to know for Friday and the weekend: phone calls on the subway, a boy band in Midtown, and city rock and roll history.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/new-york-today-can-you-hear-me-now/', 'snippet': 'What you need to know for Friday and the weekend: phone calls on the subway, a boy band in Midtown, and city rock and roll history.', 'lead_paragraph': ' Soon you may long for the squeal of train against track and the squeak of underground rats.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimed