ization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa2add0e-c422-5a17-8c39-3097807ad81b', 'word_count': 848, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa2add0e-c422-5a17-8c39-3097807ad81b'}, {'abstract': 'The United States military is becoming a major technology incubator, as it is increasingly scouted for expertise on projects related to public and private security.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/daily-report-pentagon-becomes-source-of-support-for-silicon-valley/', 'snippet': 'The United States military is becoming a major technology incubator, as it is increasingly scouted for expertise on projects related to public and private security.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the ranks of technology incubator programs, there is AngelPad in San Francisco and Y Combinator about 40 miles south in Mountain View. And then there is the Pentagon, Somini Sengupta reports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-articleLarge-v4.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-jumbo-v6.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/30/technology/bits-daily-report/bits-daily-report-superJumbo-v3.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url':