read.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/ads-coming-to-a-bathroom-stall-near-you/', 'snippet': 'These entrepreneurs found a captive audience with a little time on its hands and a willingness to read.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last fall, Bryan Silverman called a barbecue restaurant a mile from his campus at Duke University to ask the owner whether he would be interested in saving a little money on his facilities costs. The owner, Bill Whittington, was intrigued. Mr. Silverman offered The Blue Note Grill in Durham, N.C., free toilet paper printed with a Quick Response (QR) code ad for the restaurant, as well as ads for other local businesses, in exchange for stocking the toilet paper in the Blue Note’s bathrooms.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ads, Coming to a Bathroom Stall Near You', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bathrooms and Toilets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coupons', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Campbell, Tom', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ANN ARBOR (MICH)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Durham (NC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T11:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melinda F. Emerson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melinda', 'middlename': 'F.', 'lastname': 'Emerson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/418081e0-e475-586b-a555-979a522c229e', 'word_count': 854, 'uri': 'nyt://article/418081e0-e475-586b-a555-979a522c229e'}, {'abstract': 'Moscow said it was now up to the opposition to guarantee safe access for United Nations investigators to examine the site of a suspected chemical weapons attack near Damascus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/24/world/middleeast/syria-chemical-attack.html', 'snippet': 'Moscow said it was now up to the opposition to guarantee safe access for United Nations investigators to examine the site of a suspected chemical weapons attack near Damascus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Russia urged the government of President Bashar al-Assad of Syria on Friday to allow United Nations investigators to examine evidence of a suspected chemical weapons attack this week, joining the United States in seeking a full accounting of what happened early Wednesday in the eastern suburbs of Damascus, the Syrian capital.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia Urges Syria to Cooperate in Chemical Weapons Inquiry', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia Urges Syria to Cooperate in Chemical Weapons Inquiry', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Biological and Chemical Warfare', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Damascus (Syria)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T11:32:04+0000', 'documen