ts “defensive driving” to deal better with mistakes by others.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The chief executive of the Nasdaq stock exchange, Robert Greifeld, on Friday shot back at criticism of how his exchange handled a three-hour halt in trading on Thursday afternoon.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nasdaq Chief Defends Handling of Trading Halt', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nasdaq Composite Index', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Greifeld, Robert', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NASDAQ OMX Group Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T14:29:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nathaniel Popper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathaniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Popper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e48b981-5690-523a-badc-2e471e49796f', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e48b981-5690-523a-badc-2e471e49796f'}, {'abstract': 'The sports commentator discusses jeans, genes and rumors about his hair.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/magazine/does-espns-john-clayton-have-a-secret-ponytail.html', 'snippet': 'The sports commentator discusses jeans, genes and rumors about his hair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You just covered 12 different team practices in the last 11 days. What did you dream about being when you grew up?  I wanted to cover the N.F.L. I started when I was in high school — at The St. Marys Daily Press, in 1972. I was 18 years old. I got a press pass for the Pittsburgh Steelers for the entire season. I covered the Immaculate Reception 