to talk about.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When you wake up at 3:30 a.m. to go to a job that starts in the predawn hours, lunch comes early. So, on a recent weekday morning at 10:45, Gayle King, one of the hosts of “CBS This Morning,” and Mika Brzezinski, the sparring partner of Joe Scarborough on “Morning Joe” on MSNBC, came together at Gotham Lounge at the Peninsula Hotel, dressed in near-matching green sheathes and very high heels, to share a midday meal (burrata and chicken Caesar salad for Ms. King; burrata and hot-and-sour soup for Ms. Brzezinski; freshly squeezed orange juice for both) and to talk about the demands of morning television, the roles of male and female anchors and not knowing who Russell Brand is.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/fashion/25TABLE_SPAN/25TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/fashion/25TABLE_SPAN/25TABLE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/fashion/25TABLE_SPAN/25TABLE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/fashion/25TABLE_SPAN/25TABLE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1325, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/fashion/25TABLE_SPAN/25TABLE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/fashion/25TABLE_SPAN/25TABLE-thumbStandard.