lace in New York to hear music, and it is also one of the most adventurous.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The floating concert hall Bargemusic is possibly the cutest place in New York to hear music, and it is also one of the most adventurous; its Here and Now series is among the city’s most valuable homes of new and recent work. The programs are varied, the tickets reasonably priced, and the mood low key. The series gets a big showcase this week with its annual Labor Day festival, a motley assortment of sounds with an element of surprise. While a list of works has been published on the barge’s Web site, the program and performers will differ slightly for each of the four performances (Wednesday, Friday, Saturday at 8 p.m. and next Sunday at 2 p.m.). ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE5/25GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE5/25GUIDE5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE5/25GUIDE5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE5/25GUIDE5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE5/25GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE5/25GUIDE5-thumbStandard.jpg',