cted as some kind of monolith, and from a distance, Electric Zoo submits to the prevailing stereotype.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dance music is often depicted as some kind of monolith, and from a distance, Electric Zoo — a multistage festival held on Randalls Island every Labor Day weekend, now in its fifth year — submits to the prevailing stereotype. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/25GUIDE1_SPAN/25GUIDE1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Microcultures on the Island', 'kicker': 'The We