d Venetian “barber poles,” is taking center stage in high-end automotive interiors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/automobiles/wood-that-proudly-wears-the-marks-of-previous-use.html', 'snippet': 'Reclaimed wood, including from old fence posts and Venetian “barber poles,” is taking center stage in high-end automotive interiors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'VENICE — “Those poles look so old,” my companion said, pointing to the striped “barber poles” lining the canals. “I wonder how long they last in that salt water?”', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 324, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 324}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 553, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1107, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/automobiles/Wood2/Wood2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150