ulators can do about it.', 'web_url': 'https://nocera.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/joe-on-wnycs-money-talking-aug-23-2013/', 'snippet': 'Joe Nocera discuses the real impact of software malfunctions on financial markets and what regulators can do about it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How vulnerable are financial markets to computer glitches? The Nasdaq stock exchange was paralyzed for more than three hours this week because of technical problem and Goldman Sachs reportedly lost $100 million after erroneous algorithmic trades. Joe Nocera of The New York Times and Rana Foroohar of Time magazine spoke with Heidi Moore of the Guardian on WNYC’s “Money Talking” about the real impact of software malfunctions on financial markets and what regulators can do about it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Joe on WNYC’s “Money Talking”: Aug. 23, 2013', 'kicker': 'Joe Nocera', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Nasdaq Stock Market', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WNYC', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T20:49:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Nocera', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Nocera', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2cdc2d2-515c-5f72-82de-e17c83b6e907', 'word_count': 77, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2cdc2d2-515c-5f72-82de-e17c83b6e907'}, {'abstract': 'Photos from Lebanon, Egypt, Japan and Syria.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/pictures-of-the-day-lebanon-and-elsewhere-13/', 'snippet': 'Photos from Lebanon, Egypt, Japan and Syria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Photo