act': 'Nathan S. Webster asks why Lance Marottek, 25, returned to the Fort Peck Indian Reservation in northwestern Montana after five years in the Army.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/23/remembering-iraq-on-an-indian-reservation/', 'snippet': 'Nathan S. Webster asks why Lance Marottek, 25, returned to the Fort Peck Indian Reservation in northwestern Montana after five years in the Army.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Why go back? After five years in the Army, with 27 months spent in Iraq and much of the rest in Honolulu, why would Lance Marottek, 25, return to the northeastern Montana town of Poplar, population less than 1,000? On the rough edge of the Fort Peck Indian Reservation, with a graduating high school class of just 40 students, it offers the kind of small town life many young men join the military to flee from, never to return.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Remembering Iraq on an Indian Reservation', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Walmart Stores Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iraq', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Montana', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'North Dakota', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-23T22:29:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nathan S. Webster', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathan', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Webster', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://ar