ghts and smells of Shanghai’s exploding culinary scene. You will also find photographs of where modern writers work and where the Milanese designers of Dimore Studio live. Plus, the photographer Glen Luchford captures the season’s bold, graphic prints amid the cacophony of New York City; Amy Schumer and Aerin Lauder test-drive a snood; the artist Ranee Palone Flynn shares the process behind shooting total strangers; and velvet returns to its place atop the high-fashion throne. See all stories from the issue >>', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'T Fall Women’s Issue', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Amsden, David', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beckham, Victoria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lauder, Aerin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mara, Rooney', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Menkes, Suzy', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schumer, Amy', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-24T00:00:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9542aaa8-4ffd-5af3-9afc-2c713e1c81de', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9542aaa8-4ffd-5af3-9afc-2c713e1c81de'}, {'abstract': 'The Anti-Defamation League writes about violence against Christians in Arab and