'word_count': 1514, 'uri': 'nyt://article/67cd86fc-4144-5db5-8fb1-bdbd0564df6c'}, {'abstract': 'The Brewers’ Carlos Gomez is no longer just a defensive whiz. Compare his numbers on offense and defense with the Pirates’ Andrew McCutchen’s and Gomez does fairly well.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/sports/baseball/in-race-for-nl-mvp-gomez-deserves-votes.html', 'snippet': 'The Brewers’ Carlos Gomez is no longer just a defensive whiz. Compare his numbers on offense and defense with the Pirates’ Andrew McCutchen’s and Gomez does fairly well.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many years the basic formula for deciding who would win the Most Valuable Player award came down to the triple crown statistics — batting average, home run and runs batted in — and the record of the player’s team. There were occasional exceptions, but if a player had 140 R.B.I. for a first-place team, he had a good chance of receiving Major League Baseball’s highest single-season honor.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/DOG-SCORE/DOG-SCORE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Race for N.L. M.V.P., Gomez Deserves Votes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Race for N.L. M.V.P., Gomez Deserves Votes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gomez, Carlos (1985- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Milwaukee Brewers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCutchen, Andrew', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-24T15:37:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Benjamin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f2cb1eb3-da18-5f44-806c-52afbc52d356', 'word_count': 727, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f2cb1eb3-da18-5f44-806c-52afbc52d356'}, {'abstract': 'The South African government said that former President Nelson Mandela’s health remained critical but stable, requiring “medical interventions.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/world/africa/mandelas-health-remains-critical.html', 'snippet': 'The South African government said that former President Nelson Mandela’s health remained critical but stable, requiring “medical interventions.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'JOHANNESBURG — Former President Nelson Mandela’s health remains critical but stable, the South African government said Saturday, but doctors are required to make “medical interventions” when his health becomes unstable, according to a statement released by the office of President Jacob Zuma. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mandela’s Condition Remains Critical but Stable', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mandela’s Condition Remains Critical but Stable', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mandela, Nelson', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'South Africa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-24T15:51:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85ce2df6-e61a-5e96-9929-5c4787a21557', 'word_count': 171, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85ce2df6-e61a-5e96-9929-5c4787a21557'}, {'abstract': 'After stints playing for three other N.F.L. teams, in the Arena Football League and in Canada, Garrett McIntyre has become a Jets starter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/sports/football/linebacker-settles-in-at-last-with-the-jets.html', 'snippet': 'After stints playing for three other N.F.L. teams, in the Arena Football League and in Canada, Garrett McIntyre has become a Jets starter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FLORHAM PARK, N.J. — Linebacker Garrett McIntyre exuded pride as he assessed a seven-year professional football career that has taken him to two countries, three leagues and six teams.', 'print_section