otive colors have changed over the years, but we have settled firmly into the lackluster trio of white, black and silver.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Have you looked at the cars around you recently? I mean, really looked at them? I guess it depends on where you live, but there’s a pretty good chance that many of the vehicles you see at any given time will be silver, black, white, gray or some sort of brown or muted blue.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/automobiles/wheels/white-mercedes-benz/white-mercedes-benz-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/23/automobiles/wheels/white-mercedes-benz/white-mercedes-benz-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/automobiles/wheels/white-mercedes-benz/white-mercedes-benz-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 798, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/automobiles/wheels/white-mercedes-benz/white-mercedes-benz-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 448, 'width': 798, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/23/automobiles/wheels/white-mercedes-benz/white-mercedes-benz-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/23/automobiles/wheels/white-mercedes-benz/white-mercedes-benz-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08