, {'abstract': 'The stone rolls down again and again.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/24/the-macroeconomics-of-sisyphus/', 'snippet': 'The stone rolls down again and again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Simon Wren-Lewis is deeply annoyed at the IMF, and understandably so. How can you publish a paper about fiscal adjustment that explicitly takes no account of monetary policy, and claim that it has any relevance to current problems?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Macroeconomics of Sisyphus', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-24T20:47:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91485abe-a91e-5957-b1a5-db2e0bae898f', 'word_count': 283, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91485abe-a91e-5957-b1a5-db2e0bae898f'}, {'abstract': 'Ashleigh Barty, an Australian who reached the women’s doubles final of the Australian Open in January at age 16, played in the Wimbledon doubles final three months later.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/sports/tennis/at-17-a-two-time-grand-slam-finalist.html', 'snippet': 'Ashleigh Barty, an Australian who reached the women’s doubles final of the Australian Open in January at age 16, played in the Wimbledon doubles final three months later.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With all the buzz around top players like Serena Williams and Tommy Haas playing well in their 30s, it might have been easy to overlook the teenage girl who made two Grand Slam finals this year. ', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype':