rty National Golf Club.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/sports/golf/woodland-tied-with-kuchar-atop-barclays.html', 'snippet': 'With scores plummeting, Gary Woodland and Matt Kuchar are tied for the lead at 12 under par after three rounds at Liberty National Golf Club.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERSEY CITY — The good news for Gary Woodland is he is tied for the lead at the Barclays with Matt Kuchar at 12-under-par 201. The better news is there is one round left to play in the first event of the FedEx Cup playoffs at Liberty National Golf Club, affording him a prime opportunity to reverse a disappointing trend.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Woodland Tied With Kuchar Atop Barclays', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Woodland Tied With Kuchar Atop Barclays', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kuchar, Matt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woodland, Gary', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-25T00:41:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2a3ddfc4-f645-5be1-ad4e-c32a94b068e7', 'word_count': 342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2a3ddfc4-f645-5be1-ad4e-c32a94b068e7'}, {'abstract': 'Will Take Charge, trained by the Hall of Famer D. Wayne Lukas, pulled off an upset in the Travers Stakes at Saratoga.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/sports/in-travers-colt-finally-attracts-attention-of-people-besides-his-trainer.html', 'snippet': 'Will Take Charge, trained by the Hall of Famer D. Wayne Lukas, pulled off an upset in the Travers Stakes at Saratoga.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SARATOGA SPRINGS, N.Y. — No one was paying attention to D. Wayne Lukas and his colt as the spring turned to summer. If Will Take Charge had distinguished himself at all, it was for competing in all three legs of the Triple Crown. But he did not perform very well: he was beaten by a combined 45 ½ lengths in those American Classics.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 950, 'width': 1425, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/sports/travers/travers-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline'