chools Grow, Fueling New Concerns', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Learning', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Texas', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'K12 Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Connections Education LLC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-25T01:19:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Morgan Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Morgan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eab79b4c-b182-5c53-91b9-82ba38372bbf', 'word_count': 626, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eab79b4c-b182-5c53-91b9-82ba38372bbf'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Post had a long, busy career making episodes of “Gunsmoke” and “Rawhide,” directing Clint Eastwood in two hit films, and winning praise for a Vietnam War movie, “Go Tell the Spartans.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/25/movies/ted-post-director-for-film-and-television-dies-at-95.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Post had a long, busy career making episodes of “Gunsmoke” and “Rawhide,” directing Clint Eastwood in two hit films, and winning praise for a Vietnam War movie, “Go Tell the Spartans.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ted Post, a prolific director who collaborated with Clint Eastwood on two hit films, directed hundreds of episodes of television series like “Gunsmoke,” “Peyton Place” and “Rawhide,” and made a low-budget film about the Vietnam War that was widely ignored when it was released in 1978 but is now regarded by many critics as one of the best in its genre, died on Tuesday in Los Angeles. He was 95. His son, Robert, confirmed the death.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 568, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 568}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 970, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1940, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/arts/dog-post-obit/dog-post-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ted Post, Director for Film and Television, Dies at 95', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ted Post, 95, Director\r\nFor Movies and Television', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Post, Ted (1918-2013)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 