nious parting, Keith Olbermann and the network are putting on happy faces for their reunion Monday on “Olbermann” on ESPN2.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/business/media/olbermann-and-espn-together-again.html', 'snippet': 'Sixteen years after an acrimonious parting, Keith Olbermann and the network are putting on happy faces for their reunion Monday on “Olbermann” on ESPN2.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sixteen years after an acrimonious parting, Keith Olbermann and ESPN are putting on happy faces for their highly anticipated reunion, the premiere on Monday of “Olbermann” on ESPN2, the spinoff channel that Mr. Olbermann helped start, falteringly, in 1993. This time, both sides say, no faltering.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/business/media/26OLBERMANN/26OLBERMANN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/26/business/media/26OLBERMANN/26OLBERMANN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/business/media/26OLBERMANN/26OLBERMANN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/business/media/26OLBERMANN/26OLBERMANN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/business/media/26OLBERMANN/26OLBERMANN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/26/bu