al of recent years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The episodes ran the gamut of dangerous situations faced by New York City police officers: a man stabbing his ex-girlfriend; a driver fleeing the police in a stolen car; a group of young men thought to be heading for a hidden weapon; a gunman firing at plainclothes officers on a darkened street.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Surge in Shootings by Officers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Surge In Shootings By Officers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-25T20:42:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By J. David Goodman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'J.', 'middlename': 'David', 'lastname': 'Goodman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31695d2d-0c36-568f-a456-48735429ccdb', 'word_count': 710, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31695d2d-0c36-568f-a456-48735429ccdb'}, {'abstract': 'The rookie catcher Travis d’Arnaud hit his first major league home run, but the Tigers ultimately muscled their way to a three-game sweep at Citi Field.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/darnaud-provides-bright-spot-in-otherwise-dismal-series-for-mets.html', 'snippet': 'The rookie catcher Travis d’Arnaud hit his first major league home run, but the Tigers ultimately muscled their way to a three-game sweep at Citi Field.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are fine glimpses of the future throughout the Mets’ clubhouse these days, playing roles in wins and losses, producing runs and quality starts, learning and developing.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 375, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 375}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 640, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1280, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/subMETS/subMETS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Limp Away From Tigers With Rookie’s Homer as Biggest Highlight ', 'kicker': 'Tigers 11, Mets 3', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets Limp Away From Tigers With Rookie’s Homer as Biggest Highlight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': "d'Arnaud, Travis", 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'