6c-1344-5d7d-bf1e-5e4856b48d1a'}, {'abstract': 'Alfonso Soriano scored on Curtis Granderson’s sacrifice fly in the 11th and Mariano Rivera earned his 38th save as the Yankees eked out a crucial win.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/yankees-find-a-way-to-avoid-a-sweep.html', 'snippet': 'Alfonso Soriano scored on Curtis Granderson’s sacrifice fly in the 11th and Mariano Rivera earned his 38th save as the Yankees eked out a crucial win.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. — At age 37 with cranky knees, Alfonso Soriano is not nearly as swift as he once was. In an earlier life with the Yankees in his middle 20s, Soriano was able to rely on sheer speed and agility as he twice recorded seasons with 40 stolen bases. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-1/26yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 787, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-1/26yankees-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 787}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-1/26yankees-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 781, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-1/26yankees-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1562, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-1/26yankees-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandar