s justice system caused by years of flat financing followed by Washington’s lunatic across-the-board budget cuts known as sequestration. Their urgent plea to stop starving federal courts of adequate resources to fulfill the judiciary’s constitutional responsibilities deserves a response from Congress. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Federal Courts in Crisis', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Federal Courts in Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Courts (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Budget (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Defenders and Court-Appointed Lawyers (Criminal)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Judicial Conference of the United States', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-26T01:01:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/ad95712d-ebf5-59aa-a75c-0c9372220b3d', 'word_count': 563, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ad95712d-ebf5-59aa-a75c-0c9372220b3d'}, {'abstract': 'Adam Scott, who teed off more than an hour before the leaders, shot a five-under-par 66 in the final round to win the first tournament in the monthlong FedEx Cup playoffs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/sports/golf/scott-hanging-around-outlasts-a-tightly-packed-field-to-win-the-barclays.html', 'snippet': 'Adam Scott, who teed off more than an hour before the leaders, shot a five-under-par 66 in the final round to win the first tournament in the monthlong FedEx Cup playoffs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERSEY CITY — Adam Scott was o