ny-plans-tennis-you-never-know.html', 'snippet': 'Marion Bartoli, who retired from tennis not long after winning at Wimbledon, for the first time left the door open, perhaps ever so slightly, for a return.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Marion Bartoli said she wanted to start her own fashion line, open a tennis academy in Europe and, when her body healed, once again take up classical ballet. She said she was looking forward to relaxing, and talked about marrying one day. She plans to travel, more for leisure than work. She will find new hobbies.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bartoli Has Many Plans. Tennis? ‘You Never Know.’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bartoli Has Many Plans. Tennis? ‘You Never Know.’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taylor, Nate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bartoli, Marion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-26T02:11:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/338985c0-becf-5b50-88e0-d066d6813554', 'word_count': 690, 'uri': 'nyt://article/338985c0-becf-5b50-88e0-d066d6813554'}, {'abstract': 'Messages of love and rememberance, some from Lauren Daverin’s large, close-knit family, including one from her husband, were tied to the fencing of the footbridge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/nyregion/man-is-charged-with-killing-of-long-island-teenager.html', 'snippet': 'Messages of love and rememberance, some from Lauren Daverin’s larg