faster than the base model, but get a load of the Elmiraj concept.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I think Cadillac, my mental archive scrolls back to that crisp black and white image of Muhammad Ali, sitting next to his mother and looking over his shoulder from the driver’s seat of a new Cadillac. For many people then, the first stop upon arrival at success was probably a Cadillac dealership. Frank Sinatra had one; Elvis owned many over the years.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/automobiles/wheels/Cadillac-XTS-rear/Cadillac-XTS-rear-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/26/automobiles/wheels/Cadillac-XTS-rear/Cadillac-XTS-rear-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/automobiles/wheels/Cadillac-XTS-rear/Cadillac-XTS-rear-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/automobiles/wheels/Cadillac-XTS-rear/Cadillac-XTS-rear-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 627, 'width': 1115, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/26/automobiles/wheels/Cadillac-XTS-rear/Cadillac-XTS-rear-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/26/automobiles/wheels/Cadillac-XTS-rear/Cadillac-XTS-rear-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/0