e Daily News.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/the-ad-campaign-quinn-highlights-endorsements/', 'snippet': 'Christine C. Quinn’s new ad highlights her editorial-page endorsements by The New York Times, The New York Post and The Daily News.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Moving quickly to highlight newspaper editorial-page endorsements she had just collected, Christine C. Quinn, a Democratic candidate for mayor, released her third English-language television advertisement on Monday. Called “It’s Unanimous,” the ad spotlights her endorsements by The New York Times, The New York Post and The Daily News.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Ad Campaign: Quinn Highlights Endorsements', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quinn Highlights Endorsements in 3 Papers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Endorsements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-26T22:43:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Chen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e9c59bb-c239-5dcc-a81a-7880bff3e7e8', 'word_count': 356, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e9c59bb-c239-5dcc-a81a-7880bff3e7e8'}, {'abstract': 'Bethanie Mattek-Sands, often called the Lady Gaga of tennis, will walk onto the court at the United States Open on Monday with bright purple hair.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/26/bethanie-mattek-sands-makes-fashion-statements-with-her-hair/', 'snippet': 'Bethanie Mattek-Sands, often called the Lady Gaga of tennis, will walk onto the court at the United States Open on Monday with bright purple hair.', 'lead_paragraph': 'She is known for her knee socks, war paint, tattoos and, of course, her tennis ball fringe jacket from Wimbledon 2011. But this summer, Bethanie Mattek-Sands, often called the Lady Gaga of tennis, has been making fashion statements with her hair. At Wimbledon, she wore a blue, lime green and yellow updo after a brief flirtation with a more subdued look (blond ponytail, black knee socks) at the French Open. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bethanie Mattek-Sands Makes Fashion Statements With Her Hair', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mattek-Sands, Bethanie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-26T22:46:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilary Howard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Howard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/134c9546-400e-522b-8e6f-a332febdf8c4', 'word_count': 212, 'uri': 'nyt://article/134c9546-400e-522b-8e6f-a332febdf8c4'}, {'abstract': 'Aljaz Bedene lost in the first round of the United States Open on Monday; last year in New York, he had his appendix