ut evidence later emerged that no flash had been used.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/27/nyregion/officer-is-indicted-on-charges-of-lying-about-photographers-arrest.html', 'snippet': 'The officer, Michael Ackermann, claimed that Robert Stolarik’s camera flash interfered with a girl’s arrest last year, but evidence later emerged that no flash had been used.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A New York City police officer who had arrested a photographer working for The New York Times has been indicted on three felony counts and five misdemeanors accusing him of fabricating the reasons for the arrest, the Bronx district attorney announced on Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Officer Is Indicted on Charges of Lying About Photographer’s Arrest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Police Officer Is Charged With Lying About the Reasons for a Times Photographer’s Arrest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stolarik, Robert', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ackermann, Michael (New York, NY, Police Officer)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-26T23:33:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Russ Buettner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Russ', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buettner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role':