-agenda-paulsons-misgivings-on-bailout-bonuses/', 'snippet': 'Henry M. Paulson Jr., formerly Treasury secretary, criticized outsize bank bonuses paid after the bailouts. | William A. Ackman has sold his entire stake in J.C. Penney. | Arbitration lawyers are profiting from geopolitical problems. | Wall Street...', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the five-year anniversary of the white-knuckled days of the financial crisis approaches, Henry M. Paulson Jr., formerly Treasury secretary, spoke emphatically about the outsize bank bonuses paid after the bailouts. He said the bonuses were a primary reason for the public outrage over the program he worked hard to persuade Congress to pass and the country to support.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paulson’s Misgivings on Bailout Bonuses', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-27T11:58:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By William Alden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'William', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3540b1d3-6ed2-5c80-a41e-77e55a0c8fe1', 'word_count': 1472, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3540b1d3-6ed2-5c80-a41e-77e55a0c8fe1'}, {'abstract': 'For this Music Match cover pairing, the song where Michael Jackson introduced the moonwalk and a remake by the duo The Civil Wars.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/27/booming/billie-jean-twice-jacksons-way-and-as-sultry-ballad.html', 'snippet': 'For this Music Match cover pairing, the song where Michael Jackson introduced the moonwalk and a remake by the duo The Civil Wars.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Val Haller, a music-obsessed baby boomer and the founder of the Web site Valslist.com, matches tracks from her