aving him 10 from tying Willie Mays and earning the first of a series of five, $6 million bonuses.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/27/rodriguez-quietly-reaches-a-milestone-with-another-in-sight/', 'snippet': 'The Yankees’ Alex Rodriguez hit his 650th home run Monday night, leaving him 10 from tying Willie Mays and earning the first of a series of five, $6 million bonuses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — Alex Rodriguez hit his 650th home run Monday night, leaving him within sight of a remarkable milestone. With 10 more homers he will match Willie Mays, who hit 660 home runs in his 22-year career. The home run also brought Rodriguez within reach the first of a series of five, $6 million bonuses.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rodriguez Quietly Reaches a Milestone, With Another in Sight', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mays, Willie', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Alex', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-27T23:28:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/01f2e38f-e750-5813-826a-0245b2477a0b', 'word_count': 344, 'uri': 'nyt://article/01f2e38f-e750-5813-826a-0245b2477a0b'}, {'abstract': 'Steve Lonegan is waging a campaign to be the first Republican in 40 years elected to the Senate from New Jersey, and he has no intention of letting it be dull.', 'web_u