ng himself: persuade a jury to spare his life.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/28/us/judge-denies-defense-lawyers-request-in-fort-hood-case.html', 'snippet': 'Former lawyers for Maj. Nidal Malik Hasan, who was convicted of killing 13 people at the Texas military base, had sought to do what he refused to do while representing himself: persuade a jury to spare his life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KILLEEN, Tex. — The Army defense lawyers who used to represent Maj. Nidal Malik Hasan, the military psychiatrist found guilty last week of a shooting rampage at Fort Hood in November 2009, have asked the judge overseeing his military trial here to allow them to do what he refused to do while acting as his own lawyer — persuade a jury to spare his life.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/21hasan-cnd/21hasan-cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/21/us/21hasan-cnd/21hasan-cnd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/21hasan-cnd/21hasan-cnd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 746, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/21hasan-cnd/21hasan-cnd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1492, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/21/us/21hasan-cnd/21hasan-cnd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/21/us/21hasan-cn