 a potent hold on people across generations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/28/us/the-lasting-power-of-dr-kings-dream-speech.html', 'snippet': 'The Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.’s “I Have a Dream” speech, which turns 50 on Wednesday, exerts a potent hold on people across generations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was late in the day and hot, and after a long march and an afternoon of speeches about federal legislation, unemployment and racial and social justice, the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. finally stepped to the lectern, in front of the Lincoln Memorial, to address the crowd of 250,000 gathered on the National Mall. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/us/jp-KINGSPEECH-1/jp-KINGSPEECH-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/28/us/jp-KINGSPEECH-1/jp-KINGSPEECH-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/us/jp-KINGSPEECH-1/jp-KINGSPEECH-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/us/jp-KINGSPEECH-1/jp-KINGSPEECH-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1313, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/us/jp-KINGSPEECH-1/jp-KINGSPEECH-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/28/us/jp-KINGSPEECH-1/jp-KINGSPEECH-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheig