686, 'uri': 'nyt://article/61b94112-4e3c-5ac1-9c35-f7e20436ba51'}, {'abstract': 'With Robinson Cano out of the game after being hit by a pitch, Alfonso Soriano hit two home runs, and Andy Pettitte threw seven shutout innings as the Yankees kept pace in the A.L. wild-card race.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/28/sports/baseball/cano-is-hit-but-soriano-and-pettitte-strike-back-in-yankees-victory.html', 'snippet': 'With Robinson Cano out of the game after being hit by a pitch, Alfonso Soriano hit two home runs, and Andy Pettitte threw seven shutout innings as the Yankees kept pace in the A.L. wild-card race.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TORONTO — An almost inconceivable pandemic of injuries has stalked the Yankees all season, affecting almost every one of their stars and numerous backups, all except for Robinson Cano. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/sports/CITY--YANKEES/CITY--YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 388, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/28/sports/CITY--YANKEES/CITY--YANKEES-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 388}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/sports/CITY--YANKEES/CITY--YANKEES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 662, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/sports/CITY--YANKEES/CITY--YANKEES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1324, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/28/sports/CITY--YANKEES/CITY--YANKEES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 7