d7408dd500'}, {'abstract': 'Finding drug smugglers in Baja California, Mexico is easier than you may think, and driving an O.J.-style Ford Bronco into the desert is a good start.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/28/searching-for-smugglers-a-journey-through-the-mexican-desert-in-an-o-j-style-bronco/', 'snippet': 'Finding drug smugglers in Baja California, Mexico is easier than you may think, and driving an O.J.-style Ford Bronco into the desert is a good start.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Traveling from Southern California to Baja, Mexico, can be tricky. It’s a numbers game, really. Several robberies and even a sexual assault have received news coverage over the last several years, and the takeaway seems to be that the best way to avoid trouble is to keep a low profile. In other words, trucking south of the border in a surfboard-laden luxury pickup probably isn’t such a great idea.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/27/automobiles/wheels/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/27/automobiles/wheels/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/27/automobiles/wheels/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 573, 'width': 1021, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/27/automobiles/wheels/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO/Baja-Smugglers-BRONCO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 573, 'width': 1021, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': 