abundance of new products for people with curly hair may just lead to confusion in store aisles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Curly-haired women like myself often recount adolescences spent yearning for sleek, straight tresses falling down their backs. But I was a child of the ’80s, a perm-crazed time when women would stop my mother and me on the street and ask of my hair, “Is it natural?”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/fashion/29SKIN1/29zSKIN1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As the Curl Turns ...(and Turns and Turns)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As the Curl Turns ...(And Turns and Turns)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brennan, Emily', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hair', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shampoos and Hair Products', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-28T16:13:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Brennan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brennan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d4f71d3-0056-5914-88e7-ec23066ecca8', 'word_count': 934, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d4f71d3-0056-5914-88e7-ec23066ecca8'}, {'abstract': 'The Republican-controlled legislature is expected to enact a statute defying federal gun laws in the state and making it a crime for federal agents to enforce them there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/us/missouri-gun-measure-pushes-nullification-boundary.html', 'snippet': 'The Republican-controlled legislature is expected to enact a statute defying federal gun laws in the state and making it a crime for federal agents to enforce them there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JEFFERSON CITY, Mo. — Unless a handful of wavering Democrats change their minds, the Republican-controlled Missouri legislature is expected to enact a statute next month nullifying all federal gun laws in the state and making it a crime for federal agents to enforce them here. A Missourian arrested under federal firearm statutes would even be able to sue the arresting officer.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/us/