ws bigger cuts to come for a system that the French treasure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/world/europe/plan-to-tame-french-pension-shortfall-has-few-admirers.html', 'snippet': 'Some critics call the proposal insufficient and others worry that it foreshadows bigger cuts to come for a system that the French treasure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The government’s much-anticipated proposal to change the generous but underfunded French pension system has been to the liking of very few here, with many critics on Wednesday calling it insufficient and others worried that it may herald a broader unraveling of the country’s cherished system of social protections. Nor are France’s European partners likely to view the plans as representing the sort of structural overhaul they have called for.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pension Plan in France Draws Few Admirers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pension Plan in France Draws Few Admirers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pensions and Retirement Plans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Union for a Popular Movement', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ayrault, Jean-Marc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hollande, Francois', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-28T20:29:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Scott Sayare', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Scott', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sayare', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'New