 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d8cf4b9-5421-538f-9181-cc92651eef54'}, {'abstract': 'Starting a magazine may seem folly these days, but Pamela Pierce has faith that her Milieu will succeed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/garden/a-new-home-decor-magazine-but-why.html', 'snippet': 'Starting a magazine may seem folly these days, but Pamela Pierce has faith that her Milieu will succeed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Next month, Milieu, a quarterly magazine about home décor, will make its first appearance on newsstands, showcasing international houses and gardens the old-fashioned way: on thick, glossy paper. Its founder and chief editor is Pamela Pierce, 63, an interior designer in Houston who is embarking on her first publishing venture. Speaking to a reporter recently, she sounded self-assured, but didn’t shy away from the word “crazy.”', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29QNA1/29QNA1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29QNA1/29QNA1-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29QNA1/29QNA1-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29QNA1/29QNA1-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1395, 'width': 1974, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29QNA1/29QNA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thum