s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/garden/nobody-knows-the-crumbs-theyve-seen.html', 'snippet': 'A suite of colorful products for cleaning all of your devices.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Who thinks to regularly wipe down all the electronic gadgets that run our lives? Not me, for sure, at least not until several eye-pleasing cleaning tools appeared on my desk. AM, a Copenhagen company that started in the 1970s with cleaners for vinyl records and record players, has just released a suite that includes brightly colored microfiber-wrapped atomizers for both spraying and wiping phones and computers (about $15 to $35, depending on size); miniature microfiber sponges that can squirm between the Z and X keys on a crumb-filled keyboard (about $15 for five); and wet wipes, which the company says are free of harsh chemicals and can safely clean any screen (about $10 for 18).', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29CLEANING_SPAN/29CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29CLEANING_SPAN/29CURR5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29CLEANING_SPAN/29CURR5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29CLEANING_SPAN/29CURR5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/garden/29CLEANING_SPAN/29CURR5-thumbStanda