92fc-a3337b8fb15c'}, {'abstract': 'The vehicles’ proliferation in New York has been met less with nostalgia than with anger, because of traffic jams and insistent sales pitches.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/nyregion/for-many-double-decker-buses-are-merely-an-annoyance.html', 'snippet': 'The vehicles’ proliferation in New York has been met less with nostalgia than with anger, because of traffic jams and insistent sales pitches.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than a century ago, there were double-decker trolleys, rising like wedding cakes over Broadway, with horses in the neighboring lane. Many years later, diners boarded a two-tiered bus operated by the restaurateur Vincent Sardi Jr., who hoped to connect patrons at Sardi’s East, on 54th Street, to the theater district.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/nyregion/DOUBLE2/DOUBLE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/29/nyregion/DOUBLE2/DOUBLE2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/nyregion/DOUBLE2/DOUBLE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/nyregion/DOUBLE2/DOUBLE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/nyregion/DOUBLE2/DOUBLE2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag