rjury charge rather than the original felony charge. Ms. Zimmerman lied to Judge Lester about the couple’s finances, saying they had no money. In fact, they had received more than $130,000 in donations from a Web site Mr. Zimmerman set up for his defense against a murder charge in the death of Trayvon Martin. The lie was revealed after prosecutors introduced recorded jailhouse phone conversations between the Zimmermans. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Florida: Zimmerman’s Wife Strikes Deal', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Florida: Zimmerman’s Wife Strikes Deal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zimmerman, Shellie', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Alvarez, Lizette', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Perjury', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zimmerman, George', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Trayvon', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T01:55:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizette Alvarez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alvarez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/bdc11da8-eeab-56e2-bc9a-42a7312e855b', 'word_count': 135, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bdc11da8-eeab-56e2-bc9a-42a7312e855b'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on August 29, 2013.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/pageoneplus/corrections-august-29-2013.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on August 29, 2013.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FRONT PAGE', 'print_section': 'A', 'p