-56a0a48e684c'}, {'abstract': 'A sprawling exhibition of National Geographic photography displays images familiar and forgotten from the magazine’s 125 years, while its curators wonder what’s next.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/for-125-years-showing-the-beauty-and-the-tragedy/', 'snippet': 'A sprawling exhibition of National Geographic photography displays images familiar and forgotten from the magazine’s 125 years, while its curators wonder what’s next.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An exhibition celebrating the 125th anniversary of National Geographic magazine will open at the Annenberg Space for Photography Oct. 26 and run through April 27, 2014. The show is a modern response to the history of the magazine, with most of the 500 images displayed on digital screens. It was co-curated by Sarah Leen, National Geographic’s newly appointed director of photography, and her husband, Bill Marr, its creative director.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At National Geographic, 125 Years of Showing Beauty and Tragedy', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Annenberg Space for Photography', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Geographic', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T09:00:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62312359-a9c2-5e81-b3f8-2b7d37f214e6', 'word_count': 1529, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62312359-a9c2-5e81-b3f8-2b7d37f214e6'}, {'abstract': 'The suspect, J