agments — “moon,” “fangled,” “sreel” — raising questions about whether it had been hacked or was trying to keep pace with popular nonsense-spouting accounts like Horse ebooks. But of course this pop star and former Beatle had a plan up his sleeve. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/arts/paulmcc/paulmcc-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 520, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/arts/paulmcc/paulmcc-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 313, 'width': 520, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/arts/paulmcc/paulmcc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/29/arts/paulmcc/paulmcc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/29/arts/paulmcc/paulmcc-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': "In With the ‘New': Paul McCartney Album Coming in October", 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A u2018Newu2019 Album From McCartney', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCartney, Paul', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T14:19:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title'