'}, {'abstract': 'The Egyptian authorities are spinning conspiracy theories to intimidate dissenters and rally the public.', 'web_url': 'https://latitude.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/the-tall-tales-of-cairo/', 'snippet': 'The Egyptian authorities are spinning conspiracy theories to intimidate dissenters and rally the public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Earlier this month, Egypt’s State Information Service (an official news and public relations agency) sent foreign journalists a letter complaining that “Egypt is feeling severe bitterness toward some Western media coverage that is biased to the Muslim Brotherhood” and urging “all media outlets to be accurate in their coverage and not to rely on false information.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Tall Tales of Cairo', 'kicker': 'Latitude', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tall Tales in Egypt', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al-Ahram (Egyptian Newspaper)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Muslim Brotherhood (Egypt)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Egypt', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T15:07:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ursula Lindsey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ursula', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lindsey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c37ed084-1bf5-5f64-a336-1f2ab211347b', 'word_count': 638, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c37ed084-1bf5-5f64-a336-1f2ab211347b'}, {'abstract': 'Yet another airline aims to accommodate people who can’t tolerate even the possibility of being seated near the chaos of youth.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/29/a-new-airline-class-for-the-child-intolerant/', 'snippet': 'Yet another airline aims to accommodate people who can’t tolerate even the possibility of being seated near the chaos of youth.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My sister just returned from a plane trip with yet another tale of a cranky adult growling at a couple desperately trying to soothe their child. It was an hour-and-15-minute flight from Baltimore to Providence, R.I., and, even between two adults and a bag stuffed with toys and books, the parents couldn’t seem to stop the wails.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/style/motherlode-singapore-air/motherlode-singapore-air-jumbo.png', 'height': 305, 'width': 544, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/style/motherlode-singapore-air/motherlode-singapore-air-superJumbo.png', 'height': 305, 'width': 544, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/style/motherlode-singapore-air/motherlode-singapore-air-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/25/style/motherlode-singapore-air/motherlode-singapore-air-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/25/style/motherlode-singapore-air/motherlode-singapore-air-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {