5b-8e21-ddf8802dd7be'}, {'abstract': 'From the Bronx to Coney Island, a tour of the city’s graffiti art can help slake a thirst for art in summer’s dog days.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/arts/design/graffiti-art-of-the-city-from-the-bronx-to-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'From the Bronx to Coney Island, a tour of the city’s graffiti art can help slake a thirst for art in summer’s dog days.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE situation seems desperate. Museums are in hunker-down mode, gearing up for their fall extravaganzas. Galleries are either locked up as tight as banks at midnight or force-marching through the final, forlorn days of group shows. As late August slouches toward September in New York, it always seems as if a city usually overflowing with art had suddenly run short of it: the pre-Labor-Day drought.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30STREET_SPAN/30STREET_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30STREET_SPAN/30STREET_SPAN-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 745}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30STREET_SPAN/30STREET_SPAN-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 825, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30STREET_SPAN/30STREET_SPAN-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1649, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30STREET_SPAN/30STREET_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'