less he steals a vehicle and follows instructions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/movies/ethan-hawke-runs-down-everything-in-sight-in-getaway.html', 'snippet': 'In “Getaway,” a former professional racecar driver’s wife is kidnapped, and he is warned that he will never see her again unless he steals a vehicle and follows instructions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One can only guess why Ethan Hawke felt compelled to make a high dive from the sublimity of “Before Midnight” into the twisted rubble of “Getaway.” What other reason could there be for a star to attach his name to a mindless demolition derby but the payday? Furthermore, Mr. Hawke is only the nominal star of a movie whose driving force is the ultimate muscle car — an armored Ford Shelby GT500 Super Snake — that runs amok in the streets of Sofia, Bulgaria. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30GETAWAY_SPAN/0830GETAWAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 322, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30GETAWAY_SPAN/0830GETAWAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 322}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30GETAWAY_SPAN/0830GETAWAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 549, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30GETAWAY_SPAN/0830GETAWAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1098, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/arts/30GETAWAY_SPAN/0830GETAWAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': '