two promising young players.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Teenagers like Tracy Austin and Martina Hingis used to turn in dominant seasons on the women’s tennis tour. Today major success tends to arrive later. The talented 19-year-olds Laura Robson and Caroline Garcia are not yet seriously challenging for Grand Slam titles or the top ranking. But their second-round United States Open match Wednesday night was an opportunity to check on the progress of two promising young players. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Match of Teenagers Provides Glimpse of Future', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Robson, Laura', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T22:16:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Asad Raza', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Asad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Raza', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ea80a41c-1a02-5026-ae9f-2e9753ad4eb6', 'word_count': 654, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ea80a41c-1a02-5026-ae9f-2e9753ad4eb6'}, {'abstract': 'A listing of cultural events for children, teenagers and families.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/arts/spare-times-for-children-for-aug-30-sept-5.html', 'snippet': 'A listing of cultural events for children, teenagers and families.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Back to School Jam', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare Times for Children for Aug. 30-Sept. 5', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spare Times: For Children', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 's