hings,” said Capt. John Doswell, executive director of the Working Harbor Committee, one of the event sponsors.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spare Times for Aug. 30-Sept. 5', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spare Times', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Culture (Arts)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T22:33:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anne Mancuso', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mancuso', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/416a6a32-76f8-50df-9e19-5a99b70b6d60', 'word_count': 3076, 'uri': 'nyt://article/416a6a32-76f8-50df-9e19-5a99b70b6d60'}, {'abstract': 'The escalating conflict in the Democratic Republic of Congo threatened to embroil Rwanda after a woman there was killed and her baby wounded in shelling, Rwanda’s government said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/world/africa/rwanda-warns-congo-after-shells-hit-its-territory.html', 'snippet': 'The escalating conflict in the Democratic Republic of Congo threatened to embroil Rwanda after a woman there was killed and her baby wounded in shelling, Rwanda’s government said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — The escalating conflict in the Democratic Republic of Congo threatened to embroil Rwanda after a woman there was killed and her baby wounded in shelling on Thursday, Rwanda’s government said. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rwanda Warns Congo After Shells Hit Its Territory', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rwanda: Fighting in Congo Threatens a Neighbor', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rwanda', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kulish, Nicholas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Goma (Congo, Democratic Republic of)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'March 23 Movement', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Security Council (UN)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mushikiwabo, Louise', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Congo, Democratic Republic of (Congo-Kinshasa)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T22:34:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Africa', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Kulish', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kulish', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f130a2e9-395a-5778-af1e-b8047d54636b', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f130a2e9-395a-5778-af1e-b8047d54636b'}, {'abstract': 'As I became involved with one young woman, I learned how profoundly the child welfare system could fail its teenagers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/fashion/Just-Holding-On-Through-the-Curves-modern-love.html', 'snippet': 'As I became involved with one young woman, I learned how profoundly the child welfare system could fail its teenagers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My daughter just turned 30. How is this possible when it seemed like only a week before she was a scrappy, sassy teenager? Like mothers everywhere, I don’t think I’m old enough to have delivered a baby girl who could hit such a milestone.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 332, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 332}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 567, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1134, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/fashion/01MODERNLOVE/01MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Just Holding on Through the Curves', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Just Holding On Through the Curves', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beam, Cris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foster Care', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-29T22:37:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cris Beam', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beam', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ace0a45-cd2e-58f0-951e-467eccea5542', 'word_count': 1502, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ace0a45-cd2e-58f0-951e-467eccea5542'}, {'abstract': 'Etiquette questions regarding a photo opportunist, a mother who wants her child home for the holiday, when to say “I’m sorry” and those Labor Day blues.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/fashion/photo-op-social-qs.html', 'snippet': 'Etiquette questions regarding a photo opportunist, a mother who wants her child home for the holiday, when to say “I’m sorry” and those Labor Day blues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I went to a dinner party while my wife and daughters were on an exotic vacation. A woman asked about them, so I gave a quick update and opened the photo file on my iPhone and showed her a picture of them riding camels. I expected her to pass the phone around the table. Instead, she began thumbing through all of the other photos on my phone — some of which were extremely revealing. Panicking, I retrieved the phone by saying, “You don’t want to see all of those.” The woman made a snarky comment about my obviously having something to hide. Was I wrong to give her the phone? Don, Cincinnati', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/07/28/fashion/social_inline/social_inline-articleLarge-