nd “Only the Valiant,” new on Blu-ray — bore some consistent similarities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/movies/homevideo/gordon-douglass-kiss-tomorrow-goodbye-on-blu-ray.html', 'snippet': 'Despite its diversity, the oeuvre of Gordon Douglas — director of “Kiss Tomorrow Goodbye” and “Only the Valiant,” new on Blu-ray — bore some consistent similarities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'James Cagney spent much of the 1940s trying to distance himself from the swaggering, tough-guy roles that had made him one of the definitive stars of Depression America. After extricating himself from his Warner Brothers contract in 1942, Cagney formed his own independent company, Cagney Productions, with his younger brother William, to make films for release through United Artists.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01KEHR_SPAN/01KEHR-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01KEHR_SPAN/01KEHR-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01KEHR_SPAN/01KEHR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01KEHR_SPAN/01KEHR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01KEHR_SPAN/01KEHR-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/0