8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When Money Shouts', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When Money Shouts', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Mayors', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, City Councils', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Quinn, Christine C', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Political Advertising', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NYC Is Not for Sale', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jobs for New York', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Real Estate Board of New York', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-30T01:54:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Editorial Board', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Editorial Board'}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/32203d11-3f07-5ce0-940b-d064197234ca', 'word_count': 631, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32203d11-3f07-5ce0-940b-d064197234ca'}, {'abstract': 'The closing statement by Bo Xilai, in which he denied trying to grab power, provided a glimpse of the politics in China that many believe were behind his ouster in 2012.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/world/asia/in-trial-account-chinese-ex-official-strays-from-script.html', 'snippet': 'The closing statement by Bo Xilai, in which he denied trying to grab power, provided a glimpse of the politics in China that many believe were behind his ouster in 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — In secret remarks on the final session of his tr