.com/2013/08/31/booming/a-preview-of-retro-reports-season-two.html', 'snippet': 'A look at Retro Report’s season, and an invitation to readers to suggest which big stories of the past to revisit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a summer hiatus, our weekly online video feature, Retro Report, has returned with a fresh look at one of the biggest stories of the summer of 1988, the unsuccessful attempts to control wildfires that burned through Yellowstone National Park for months.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Preview of  Retro Report’s Season Two', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wildfires', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baby Boomers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-30T10:00:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Booming', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Winerip', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Winerip', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3f9a520c-4d84-5ef3-9179-8f1a862339fe', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3f9a520c-4d84-5ef3-9179-8f1a862339fe'}, {'abstract': 'Part El Camino, mostly Trabant, Liz Cohen’s Frankensteined art car cum lowrider has gone from the art world to lowrider shows and back again.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/look-its-a-trabant-its-an-el-camino-its-the-trabantimino/', 'snippet': 'Part El Camino, mostly Trabant, Liz Cohen’s Frankensteined art car cum lowrider has gone from the art world to lowrider shows and back again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The town of Española, N.M., bears the nickname, “The Lowrider Capital of the World.” Each su