season in Cartoon Network’s Adult Swim lineup.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Patton Oswalt moved gingerly as he eased onto a sofa on the Bushwick, Brooklyn, set of “The Heart, She Holler.” He was slowed, perhaps, by fatigue after a full morning of shooting this show, a Southern gothic horror-comedy. Or maybe it was the bloody rabbit’s foot sticking out of his chest.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/arts/01HEARTHOLLER1_SPAN/01HEART-HOLLER1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name