For others, it’s a particular kind of hell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This summer, 39 members of the Peters family gathered in Smith Mountain Lake, Va., just outside Roanoke, for their 40th family reunion. What started with five nearby families in 1970 has grown to 10 families, some from as far away as Alaska and Washington State. Activities included water-skiing, a pickleball tournament and TV theme-song trivia night.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 989, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 660, 'width': 989, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/02/fashion/01THISLIFE_SPAN/01THISLIFE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge'