ng justice to Skype and an eye-popping collection of sexism horror stories from women in the technology industry.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every day, The New York Times’s staff scours the Web for interesting and peculiar items. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 500, 'width': 500, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/11/11/blogs/scuttlebot/scuttlebot-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Today’s Scuttlebot: Skype a Decade Later and Why There Aren’t Enough Women in Tech', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-30T21:45:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6787b45-27c6-5432-bd0a-d0c190af460a', 'word_count': 261, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6787b45-27c6-5432-bd0a-d0c190af460a'}, {'abstract': 'Darrelle Revis, traded by the Jets in April, knows that the Buccaneers are taking a chance that he can recover fully from a torn knee ligament. “But I’m betting on myself. Wouldn’t you?” Revis said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytim