: 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/533d634a-86d3-5021-8f55-1c344284419e', 'word_count': 137, 'uri': 'nyt://article/533d634a-86d3-5021-8f55-1c344284419e'}, {'abstract': 'Beauty we probably won’t see again.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/friday-night-music-missing-the-civil-wars/', 'snippet': 'Beauty we probably won’t see again.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Civil Wars have a new, and presumably final album. It’s lovely; but I haven’t been able to bring myself to post any of the official videos, because I keep thinking of what we lost when they had their falling out. What I always loved most was the magic of those live performances, and it doesn’t look as if we’ll have those ever again.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Friday Night Music: Missing the Civil Wars', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-30T23:29:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/60ef9ef1-937e-5708-982a-651f7595b208', 'word_count': 79, 'uri': 'nyt://article/60ef9ef1-937e-5708-982a-651f7595b208'}, {'abstract': 'From taxidermy footwear to a fashion week invitation in the form of a prescription, ten fashion developments in the week that was.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/30/seven-days-of-chic-fashion-pills-and-furry-shoes/', 'snippet': 'From taxidermy footwear to a fashion week invitation in the form of a prescription, ten fashion developments in the week that was.', 'lead_paragraph': '1. “Girls