ng for Adam Scott that the player of the year on the PGA Tour is not decided by an audience vote. His caddie, Steve Williams, got more shout-outs from the fans following his group Friday at the Deutsche Bank Championship. Such was Scott’s lot when he found himself in the marquee pairing with Tiger Woods and Phil Mickelson, who have a firm hold on the golf viewing public, if not the award.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 547, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 547}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 933, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1866, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/31/sports/REFERgolf/REFERgolf-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mickelson’s Hot Play Makes Him Co-Leader', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mickelson Continues Hot Play for Share of the Lead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mickelson, Phil', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Brian', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-31T01:34:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bfbeaff7-8708-56c3-ae45-9fca46fcf7a8', 'word_count': 838, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bfbeaff7-8708-56c3-ae45-9fca46fcf7a8'}, {'abstract': 'A group that spent millions on lobbying declares its mission accomplished.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/31/nyregion/business-leaders-committee-that-backed-cuomo-finishes-its-business-and-shuts-down.html', 'snippet': 'A group that spent millions on lobbying declares its mission accomplished.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Committee to Save New York, a coalition of business leaders that spent millions of dollars supporting the agenda of Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo and that seemed, overnight, to become the biggest lobbying force in Albany, said on Friday that it was shutting down.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Business Leaders’ Committee That Backed Cuomo Finishes Its Business and Shuts Down', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Group of Business Leaders That Backed Cuomo Shuts Down', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name':