anes and paths have proliferated, and the island’s two biggest cities have launched bike-share programs. The trend didn’t happen by itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2013/08/30/world/asia/20130830TAIWAN.html', 'snippet': 'Bike sales have surged in Taiwan, bike lanes and paths have proliferated, and the island’s two biggest cities have launched bike-share programs. The trend didn’t happen by itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bike sales have surged in Taiwan, bike lanes and paths have proliferated, and the island’s two biggest cities have launched bike-share programs. The trend didn’t happen by itself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/world/asia/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/08/30/world/asia/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/world/asia/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/world/asia/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/08/30/world/asia/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV/20130830TAIWAN-slide-C3MV-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/08/30/world/asia/