on and Leger Douzable made Garay expendable. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jets Trim Roster, Cutting Kicker and Veteran Tackle', 'kicker': 'Sports Briefing | Pro Football', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jets Trim Roster, Cutting Kicker and Veteran Tackle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-31T03:34:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/30460312-06d9-57ef-9c1a-4df43fb7e607', 'word_count': 62, 'uri': 'nyt://article/30460312-06d9-57ef-9c1a-4df43fb7e607'}, {'abstract': 'Martina Hingis ended the first match of her Open return by double-faulting twice in a doubles loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/08/31/sports/tennis/back-to-back-double-faults-spoil-hingiss-return.html', 'snippet': 'Martina Hingis ended the first match of her Open return by double-faulting twice in a doubles loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martina Hingis smashed nearly a dozen backhand volleys for winners, traded deft short shots and jumped high to crush overheads in her return to the United States Open on Friday. But none of that mattered in a loss with her doubles partner, Daniela Hantuchova of Slovakia, against the Open’s top-seeded doubles team, Sara Errani and Roberta Vinci of Italy. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Back-to-Back Double Faults Spoil Hingis’s Return', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_he