 striker Thierry Henry had a confrontation on the practice field earlier in the week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/sports/soccer/can-red-bulls-turn-a-scuffle-into-a-win.html', 'snippet': 'Coach Mike Petke of the Red Bulls, who were to play D.C. United, and the team’s star striker Thierry Henry had a confrontation on the practice field earlier in the week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Red Bulls have not won a match since Aug. 3.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Can Red Bulls Turn a Scuffle Into a Win?', 'kicker': 'Preview', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Red Bulls (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Petke, Mike', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Henry, Thierry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-31T17:02:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Bell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/93c64c2e-2ca3-5654-b2d1-5df4f5c6764d', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/93c64c2e-2ca3-5654-b2d1-5df4f5c6764d'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama’s own caution about foreign interventions put him in this box.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/sunday-review/tripping-on-his-own-red-line.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s own caution about foreign interventions put him in this box.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — IT started with just 20 words, intended to keep Barack Obama out of a war. The tens of thousands dying in Syria was a global tragedy, he told reporters a