original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4785f02c-9d2d-5cdb-a914-b4d0256ba489', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4785f02c-9d2d-5cdb-a914-b4d0256ba489'}, {'abstract': 'Thousands of girls and women are smuggled across the Nepal-Indian border each year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/opinion/sunday/women-bought-and-sold-in-nepal.html', 'snippet': 'Thousands of girls and women are smuggled across the Nepal-Indian border each year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEPAL may be known for natural beauty and Mount Everest, but there is a dark side to this small, picturesque country. Women and girls are being bought, sold and smuggled across the Nepal-India border. Although reliable data on the scope of the issue is difficult to gather, Unicef reports that as many as 7,000 women and girls are trafficked out of Nepal to India every year, and around 200,000 are now working in Indian brothels. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sunday-review/NEPAL01/NEPAL01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/sunday-review/NEPAL01/NEPAL01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sunday-review/NEPAL01/NEPAL01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sunday-review/NEPAL01/NEPAL01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1372, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type