 President Obama’s announcement that he would ask Congress for authorization before launching a strike against Syria.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/31/lawmakers-respond-on-twitter-to-obamas-statement-on-a-syria-vote/', 'snippet': 'Some lawmakers took to Twitter to respond to President Obama’s announcement that he would ask Congress for authorization before launching a strike against Syria.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Both chambers of Congress are on recess, and many of their members are far from Washington. But the distance did not stop some of them from responding to President Obama’s statement on Saturday afternoon that he would seek Congressional authorization before launching a military strike in response to Syria’s use of chemical weapons. Many representatives and senators took to Twitter with their reactions.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lawmakers Respond on Twitter to Obama’s Statement on a Syria Vote', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clarke, Yvette D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murphy, Christopher Scott', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schiff, Adam', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Terry, Lee', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-31T19:48:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Roston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b161334a-0d60-5bbb-8990-45910113a74b', 'word_count': 417, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b161334a-0d60-5bbb-8990-45910113a74b'}, {'abstract': 'In July, the listed height on John Isner’s A.T.P. Profile page changed from 6 feet 9 inches to 6-10, an improbable growth spurt for a 28-year-old man.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/sports/tennis/for-the-atp-there-is-no-tale-of-the-tape-and-thereby-hangs-a-tale.html', 'snippet': 'In July, the listed height on John Isner’s A.T.P. Profile page changed from 6 feet 9 inches to 6-10, an improbable growth spurt for a 28-year-old man.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been one of the more lucrative summers of John Isner’s career. Over the course of five tournaments in July and August, he gained 1,250 ranking points, $551,975 in prize money, and an inch.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-tall2/DOG-tall2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-tall2/DOG-tall2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-tall2/DOG-tall2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-tall2/DOG-tall2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1009, 'width': 1514, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/spor