Dave Seminara', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Seminara', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b15e550e-1cbd-5a16-b93f-997d4a5c6949', 'word_count': 1032, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b15e550e-1cbd-5a16-b93f-997d4a5c6949'}, {'abstract': 'The Geno Smith era had to begin like this. Despite a regime change, they are still confronting underlying issues, issues illuminated by this quarterback saga.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/sports/football/the-jets-future-seems-haunted-by-their-checkered-past.html', 'snippet': 'The Geno Smith era had to begin like this. Despite a regime change, they are still confronting underlying issues, issues illuminated by this quarterback saga.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is how the Jets wanted Geno Smith to win their quarterback competition: by shining all summer long, by dominating during the preseason, by proving beyond a reasonable doubt that he was the team’s best option for Week 1. They wanted him to earn it.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1264, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/dogJets/dogJets-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Jets’ Future Seems Haunted by Their Checkered Past', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Jets’ Future Seems Haunted by Their Checkered Past', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Football', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Jets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Geno', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ryan, Rex', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sanchez, Mark', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2013-08-31T20:06:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Football', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f81cb5b-6063-524e-9669-44e11fbefcfe', 'word_count': 1000, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f81cb5b-6063-524e-9669-44e11fbefcfe'}, {'abstract': 'What a few more points of debt could have accomplished.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2013/08/31/the-arithmetic-of-fantasy-fiscal-policy/', 'snippet': 'What a few more points of debt could have accomplished.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes — usually, though not always, in a belligerent tone — people ask me, well, how big do you think the stimulus should have been? How much debt should we have run up? Regardless of the tone, that is actually a question worth answering. With the benefit of hindsight, we do know roughly how depressed the economy has been; we have reasonably good estimates of the effects of government spending; so we can put together an estimate of what would have happened if we had, in fact, pursued a policy of government spending sufficient to keep output at potential.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Arithmetic of Fantasy Fiscal Policy', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2013-08-31T20:10:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f08c24b6-cb5c-57cb-9799-f60f35c1e9ae', 'word_count': 527, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f08c24b6-cb5c-57cb-9799-f60f35c1e9ae'}, {'abstract': 'Professional teams in Australian rules football, enamored of the skills of American big men, are trying to persuade ex-collegians to switch sports.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2013/09/01/sports/football-australian-style-meets-basketball.html', 'snippet': 'Professional teams in Australian rules football, enamored of the skills of American big men, are trying to persuade ex-collegians to switch sports.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After four seasons as a solid contributor for North Dakota’s basketball team, Patrick Mitchell graduated last year with one professional option: a contract with a low-level club in Portugal. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 456, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 456}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 778, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1556, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2013/09/01/sports/DOG-australian2/DOG-australian2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Football, Australian Style, Meets Basketball', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Australian-Style Football Meets U.S. Basketball ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Australian Football', 'rank': 1, 'majo